<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Luku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukumbusa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Lukumbusa</para>
  <para style="mt">LUKUMBUSA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulongozi we chitabu cha lukumbusa ni kuvuzagizwa kwa sigilizi zikulavigwa na kutambaliswa mndani mwe vitabu vituhu vye Tolati (vitabu vishano vya nkongo mwe Dilagano dya Kale). Zina dya Chiebulania dye chitabu chino china zina dikulagisa “Milosi”. Chahamwenga vyazumilika kugamba Musa nuyo awandike chino ichitabu ukaleka lupisu lujihi mo udumo lukutambalisa mbui ye ifile yakwe. Chitabu chino chakonga kwa milosi ikugamba, “Ino niyo imilosi Musa awagambile Waizulaeli.” Fanyanyi kugamba Musa nuyo awandikaga Mbuli za Lukumbusa zalavyanywa kwa nkanana siku mwe Idilagano Hya. Mligano umwenga waubwila mwe chitabu cha Ntendwa za wasigilwa sula ya 3:22-23 hantu aho Petulo atimiliza mbuli ziwandikwe mwe chitabu cha Lukumbusa sula ya 18:15-18 niyo alonga kugamba ino yendaga ni milosi ya Musa. Vyadahika Musa awandikaga ichitabu cha Lukumbusa hamwenga ne vitabu vya Nkongo, Kulawa, Mbuli za Walawi, na Uwazwa mwe mihilimo ya 1400 hegu 1300 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Chitabu cha Lukumbusa chiwankwa uge mliganyo wa mwivano mgati mwa seuta na useuta mtuhu ukwelongoza wenye, saviya vyadamanikaga mwe chikale. Ni mwivano mwa Chohile na wantu wa Izulaeli. Chohile kazumila kuwajimbika wantu uneva du wananyanyahla na kutimila sigilizi zakwe. Uneva hegu Waizulaeli wanahituka izisigilizi za Chohile, elo nawakantilwe. Iyi niyo imbuli inkulu mwe chila hantu mwe chino ichitabu, mna vikutendesa mwe sula ya 27 na 28 mna mtintiso we ichindedi chino ukadongelesa ujimbiko wesimile na maligito vikunga vilawane na kutimila hegu kuhitukila kwa wantu wa Izulaeli. Makabila yesimane ya Izulaeli yachimalaga mwe magulu yesimane yachimale yahampikana na kulongelana ujimbiko uwo na amaligito ayo uge sila ya kulavyanya kugamba wazumila.</para>
  <para style="io">Yemndani, 1. Mwe sula ya 1 kubula ya 3 Musa akumbusa mbuli zalailaga mwe ntambo ya Waizulaeli kudeluka idijangwa. 2. Sula ya 4 kubula ya 26 zatambalisa miko ye idilago mwa Chohile na wantu wakwe. 3. Vikaheza mwe sula ya 27 kubula 30 wantu wa Izulaeli walonga ujimbiko na ligito kwa izwi kulu kulagisa kugamba kukongela chipindi icho Lagano dikigwa kale. 4. Mo udumo, sula ya 31 kubula ya 34 Musa alonga mbuli za kubindiliza kwa Yoshuwa na kwa chila kabila dya Izulaeli henati kubanika.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kolugulu lwa Helebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Chitabu chino china milosi idya Musa awagambile wantu wose wa Izulaeli chipindi wendile kwedijangwa ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mto wa Yolodani. Wendaga mwe dikolongo dya Yolodani haguhi na hantu hakwitangwa Sufu, mgati mo mzi wa Palani ntendele imwenga na mzi wa Tofeli na Labani na Hezeloti na Dizahabu kwentendele intuhu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Ni lujendo lwa mazuwa mlongo na imwenga kulaila kolugulu lwa Holebu iviya lwetangwa Sinai kubula Kadesi Balineya kwa sila ya kolugulu lwa Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Zuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi wa mlongo na umwe, mhilimo wa milongo mine, weze wakulawe kweisi ya Misili, Musa awagambilaga awantu chila chintu chiya Zumbe Chohile amlagize awagambile. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Kadamanya ivyo hadya Zumbe eze amhude seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli yudya nakekala komzi wa Heziboni, na seuta Ogu ywa Bashani yudya nendile akekala komzi wa Ashitaloti na Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Musa niyo akonga kuwagambila isigilizi ya Chohille hadya wendile kwe ntendele ya ulaillo wa zuwa womzi wo mto wa Yolodani mwe isi ya Moabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Awagamba vino, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Hadya chendaga kolugulu lwa Sinai, Zumbe, Chohile ywetu, kachigamba vino, ‘Mwikala kwa mazuwa yalozize molugulu luno lwa, <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />haluse samizani inkambi yenyu mjendeleze nentambo. Hitani kweisi ya magulu ya Waamoli na ntendele ya si zihaguhi za Alaba, kwa magulu na mabwandasi, uko Negebu na ntendele za mpwani. Mwite kubula isi ya Kanaani na isi ya Lebanoni na kubula koumto umkulu wa Fulati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Kaulani isi ino yose siika kulongozi kwenyu. Ivyo, hitani mkekale mweisi idya miye Zumbe nelisize kuwenka wakale wenyu Bulahimu, Isaka, Yakobo na welekwa wawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa asagula vilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kuwagambila wantu, “Hadya chendaga chichei kolugulu lwa Sinai, miye nasiwagamba vino, ‘Ndima ya kuwalongozani ichedu ni ndala mwangu. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, kawatenda mjenyele, dyelo mlozesa saviya ntondo za koulanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Zumbe, Chohile ywa wababa zenyu, awatende mjenyele nkanana elufu kujinka viya mwili vino haluse na kuwajimbikani saviya alagize! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Elo, miye ichedu nanidahe vivihi kujesa ndima ihimbile ya kulamwila nkumbizi zenyu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Sagulani kulaila mwe chila kabila wantu wata ubala na fanyanyi na umanyi, miye naniwatende watende vilongozi wenyu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Nyuwe nanywi mwazumilaga, mwanihitula vino, ‘Ulosi ulongile ni wedi wa kudamanya.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ivyo siwaguha masekulu wata ubala na fanyanyi na umanyi wadya msagule kulaila mwa amakabila yenyu, siwatenda vilongozi wenyu. Watuhu siwasagula watenda wakulu wa mabunga ya wantu elufuelufu, watuhu siwatenda masekulu wa mabunga ya wantu ganagana, watuhu siwatenda masekulu wa mabunga ya wantu milongo mishano shano na watuhu siwatenda vilongozi wa mabunga ya wantu milongo, na wakulu watuhu wa kudima chila kabila.”<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Chipindi chiya nawenkaga walamuzi wenyu malagizo yakutimila, ‘Tegelezani masa ya wantu wenyu. Lavyani nkanto zikuwagila mwa amalaho ya awantu wenyu, naho na malaho ya wajeni wakwikala hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Msekumhingiza mntu yoyose mwe kulavya nkanto, namuwategeleze hehena kuhingiza, wakulu kwa wadodo. Msekutiswa ni mntu yoyose, kwaviya nkanto mkulavya yalawa kwa Chohile. Hegu hana laho dyodyose dala mwenyu nigailani miye nanidyetegeleze.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Chipindi chiya siwalagizani mbuli zose mkungwa mdamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa asigila wapelembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Ivyo, saviya Zumbe, Chohile ywetu, achilagize, chakongaga intambo yetu kulaila kolugulu lwa Holebu, chijinka mwedijangwa idikulu dikutisa mdimanyize, kwa kutimila isila ikuhinga isi ya amagulu ya Waamoli. Chize chibule Kadeshi Balineya, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />miye siwagamba, ‘Haluse mbula mwe isi ya amagulu ya Waamoli idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, akuchinka. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Kaulani, Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, kaika isi ino kulongozi kwenyu. Ivyo! Ingilani, mkekale saviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wakale wenyu awagambileni. Msekogoha naho msekutenda na nkama!’”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Mna nyose niyo mweza hangu nakunigamba, ‘Chisigile wantu wachilongwele, wakaipelembe isi, wakaheza wauye wachigambile sila yedi ya kutimila na mizi ihi nachiibwile uko.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Imbuli iyo iwoneka kugamba ni yedi kwangu, sisagula wantu mlongo na waidi, mntu yumwenga mwe chila kabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Niyo waita mwe isi idya ya amagulu, wabula mwedibwandasi dya Eshikoli na kudipelemba. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Weze wauye, wachigaila ntunda zesimile zeisi iyo na kuchigamba kugamba isi iyo akuchinka Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, ni yedi vitendese”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Mna nyuwe hamtimile lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mlemela kwita kwe isi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mfuzuma mndani mwa amahema yenyu mkagamba, ‘Zumbe Chohile achihiwa nivyo vilekile akachilavya mwe isi ya Misili. Kaunga chihudwe ni Waamoli chani achikome. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Nimbwani chite uko chikatenda chifa chevu? Wapelembi awo wachigambaga kugamba wantu wa uko ni wakulu naho ni watali kujinka suwe, na kugamba imizi yawo ni mikulu naho ina viwambaza zikubula kwa amaingu. Naho wagamba chiwona mazintu makulu welekwa wa Anaki!’”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Mna miye siwagamba vino, ‘Msekufa chevu naho msekuwogoha awantu awo. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, yudya akuwalongwela, uyo mwenye natowane kwa chausa chenyu, saviya adamanye kulongozi kwenyu kudya Misili, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na saviya adamanye kudya kwedijangwa, kudya muwone ivyo awenule mwe ntambo iyo yose saviya tati yamntu akusumula mwanawe kubula mbula hano.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Hata hegu kadamanya ayo yose, nyuwe hamumzumile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />yudya awalongwele mwesila na kuwalondelani hantu hakwika nkambi zenyu. Nechilo kawalongwelani kwa nguzo ya moto, nomsi kwaingu, chani awalagiseni isila.”<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Awakantila Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Zumbe Chohile niyo eva amafuzumo yenyu, niyo ehiwa, nakwelisa akagamba, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Hahana hata yumwenga ywenyu mo lweleko luno lwihiye nengile mwe isi idya yedi nilagane kuwenka wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune, uyodu nuyo naiwone, miye nanimwinke isi iyo ajatile itende yakwe uyo na welekwa wakwe kwaviya katenda mzumizi vitendese kwangu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Zumbe Chohile kanifilamaya kwachausa chenyu, niyo agamba, ‘Hata weye Musa hawingile mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Mna mwambizi ywako Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, nuyo nengile umo. Ivyo, mjele moyo kwaviya nawalongoze wantu wa Izulaeli wakale mwe isi iyo.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo achigamba suwe wose, ‘Awo wana wenyu mkogoha kugamba nawatende watahwa na wankondo wenyu, awana awo mkugamba wachei hawamanyize kubunkula mgati mwa yedi na yaihiye, awo nawo nawengile uko, nami naniwenke wowo isi iyo itende yawo. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Mna nyuwe, hitukani uyani kwedijangwa kuhinga kwe Bahali ya Shamu.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Mkaheza mwanihitula, ‘Suwe chimdamanyiza wavu Zumbe Chohile, mna haluse nachite chikagombe nkondo saviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, achilagize.’ Ivyo, chila yumwenga ywenyu niyo emalanya kugomba nkondo, namfanyanya kugamba navitende vihufu kuyebunga isi iyo ya amagulu.” <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Mna Zumbe Chohile kanigamba, ‘Wagambile awo wantu wasekwita na kugomba nkondo kwaviya sihamwenga nawo, wasekwita, wanase kuhudwa na awankondo wawo.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Elo, miye siwagambilani ivyo, mna nyuwe hamwivile. Ivyodu mlemela kutimila lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile, kobezi mwingila mwe isi iyo ya amagulu. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Aho, Waamoli wendaga wakekala mwe ntendele iyo ya amagulu niyo wasela na kuwebungani saviya nyuchi zikutenda, wawatowa uko Seili kubula Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Naho muwiye, nakumwila Zumbe Chohile, mna Zumbe hawevileni na kuwatolotozani.”<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Ivyo, niyo mwasigaila uko Kadeshi mwikale kwa chipindi chitali.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wangadika mwedijangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Akaheza, chihituka, nakutamba kwedijangwa kwa kujinkila sila ye Bahali ya Shamu, saviya Zumbe Chohile anigambile, changadika haguhi no lugulu lwa Seili kwa mazuwa yalozize.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Akaheza Zumbe anigamba, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Mwangadikisa mwe isi ino ya amagulu kwa mazuwa yalozize, haluse hitukani mhinge chenya. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Wagambile wantu amalagizo yano, Mwihaguhi kujinka mwe isi ya amagulu ya Seili, isi ya walukolo wenyu welekwa wa Esau. Awo nawowogoheni, mna msinyise, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />mnase kutowana nawo kwaviya saniwenke ntendele yoyose ye isi yawo. Saniwenkeni hata hantu hadodo hatende henyu. Isi iyo ya amagulu ya Seili siwenka welekwa wa Esau itende yawo. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mkaunga nkande hegu mazi mwawo mwaungwa mgule.’” <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Ivyo, mnakumbuke ivyo Zumbe Chohile ywenyu awajimbikeni mwe chila mbuli mdamanye. Kawadimani mwendile mkangadika mwedijangwa dino kulu. Katenda hamwenga na nyuwe mwemihilimo ino yose milongo mine naho hamhungukilwe ni chintu chochose.”<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Ivyo chijendeleza ne ntambo yetu, chiwajinka walukolo wetu, welekwa wa Esau wadya wendile wakekala Seili, niyo chayasa kunyuma isila idya ya Alaba hamwenga nemizi ya Elasi na Esioni Gebeli. Vikaheza chihituka chitimila isila ya kujinkila kwedijangwa dya Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, ‘Use kuwatumbwadisa wantu wa Moabu, naho usekutowana nawo kwaviya saniwenkeni ntendele yoyose ye isi yawo. Kwaviya isi iyo ya Ali siwenka awo welekwa wa Loti itende yawo.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Aho kale isi iyo ya Ali yendaga ikekalwa ni wantu walozize, wata nguvu naho wendaga watali saviya Waanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Saviya Waanaki, wantu wano wamanyagwa seivyo saviya Walefai, mna Wamoabu wawetangaga Waemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Waholi saivyo aho kale wekalaga uko Seili, mna welekwa wa Esau wawabalazaga na kuwakoma, wakaheza wowo wenye niyo wekala mwe ntendele iyo hantu hawo, Saviya Waizulaeli wadamanyaga mwe isi idya ya Kanani Zumbe Chohile awenkaga itende yawo.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Zumbe Chohile niyo achigamba, ‘Haluse halaweni, mdeluke umto Zeledi.’ Ivyo, niyo chadeluka umto wa Zeledi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Mihilimo milongo mitatu na mnane yendaga yomboka kukongela kuhalawa Kadeshi Balineya kubula kudeluka umto wa Zeledi. Chipindi icho, lweleko lose lwa wadya wantu wo umhilimo wakwita kwenkondo kubanika kuligana neivyo Zumbe Chohile awelisize. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Zumbe Chohile mwenye kawatowa chani awakome awantu wa Izulaeli, kubula wose wasile.”<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Ivyo, wantu wose weze wabanike, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />Dyelo dino namjinke umhaka wa Moabu kwa kujinkila isi ya Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Mfikile mwe isi ya Waamoli. Msekuwatumbwadisa naho msekutowana nawo kwaviya saniwenkeni ntendele yoyose ya awo welekwa wa Amoni itende yenyu. Kwaviya awo ni welekwa wa Loti, naho siwenka isi iyo itende yawo.<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Isi iyo imanyika saviya isi ya Walefai. Walefai wendaga wakekala uko aho kale, Waamoni wawetangaga awo Wazamuzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Wendaga wantu walozize, wata nguvu na watali saviya Waanaki. Mna Zumbe Chohile niyo awakoma aho Waamoli wezaga wadya waguhaga isi yawo na kwikala umo hantu hawo. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Zumbe Chohile kadamanya saviya awadamanyizaga welekwa wa Esau, Waedomu, wadya wekalaga mwe isi ya Seili. Awakomaga Waholi hadya Waedomu wabulaga uko, waiguha isi yawo na kwikala umo kubula dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Waavi wendaga ahokale wakekala mwe kaya zimnkanda mwa Gaza. Wakafutoli kulaila mwechisiwa cha Kilete wawakomaga, niyo wekala umo ukaleka awo.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Akaheza Zumbe Chohile kachilagiza, ‘Haluse! Kongani ntambo. Jinkani idibwandasi dya Alinoni. Miye siwenkani uhuda mwa Sihoni, seuta ywa Waamoli ywa Heshiboni ne isi yakwe. Mwebungeni na kuguha isi yakwe mwikale. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Dyelo nanikonge kuwatenda wantu wose mwe isi watende na woga na nkama mwenyu. Naweve mbuli zenyu nawo nawazingize na kuhwa.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wamhuda seuta Sihoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Ivyo, niyo nasigila wantu kulaila kwedijangwa dya Kedemoti waite kwa seuta Sihoni ywa Heziboni na ulosi uno wa utondowazi ukugamba, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Chilekeile chijinke mwe isi yako. Nachijinkile mwe sila nkulu iyodu na kwita ulonaulo hachihituke kulume hegu kumoso. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Inkande yetu nachigule kwako, hata mazi yo kunywa seivyo. Icho chikulombeza ni kujinka lwa viga mgati mwe isi yako, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />saviya wachilekeile wana wa Esau wekalaga Seili, na Wamoabu wekalaga Ali, chani chideluke umto wa Yolodani chingile mwe isi chikwinkigwa ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Mna Sihoni, seuta dya Hesiboni, hachilekeile chijinke mwe isi yakwe. Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kamtenda asekwiva na mnkani ywa moyo, chani chimhude na kuguha isi yakwe idya chikwikala kubula vino dyelo.”<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, ‘Kaula, sikonga kuwenkani uhuda mwa seuta Sihoni ne isi yakwe, kongani kuiguha isi yakwe na kwikala umo.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Vikaheza Sihoni niyo afosa na wantu wakwe wose kugomba nkondo na suwe haguhi nomzi wa Yahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Mna Zumbe, Chohile ywetu, kamlavya mwetu, niyo chamhuda uyo Sihoni, wanawe na awantu wakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Chiitaha na kuibalanga imizi yakwe yose, niyo chakoma wagosi na wavyele na wana. Hachasize mntu yoyose mjima. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Mna niyo chataha ludimo na ugoli uzagale mwe mizi chitahile. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kukongela Aloeli, mzi wimo lujevu lwe dibwandasi dya Alinoni, na umzi wimwe dibwandasi dino kubula Gileadi, hahana mzi wowose una chiwambaza chitali utogile chidunduge kuuhuda. Zumbe Chohile kachinka uhuda mweimizi yose. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Mna hachisogeile isi ya Waamoni hegu molujevu lomto wa Yaboki hegu mwe mizi ye isi ya amagulu hegu ntendele yoyose idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, achilemeze chise kwita.”<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wamhuda Seuta Ogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Vikaheza, chihituka, chikwela kuhinga Bashani. Ogu seuta ywa Bashani keza na wantu wakwe wose kutowana na suwe haguhi nomzi wa Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Mna Zumbe Chohile kanigamba, ‘Usekumogoha, kwaviya sikwinka uhuda mwakwe hamwenga na awantu wakwe neisi yakwe. Nomdamanye saviya umdamanye Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli endile akakela Heshiboni.’” <verse eid="DEU 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo achinka uhuda mwa seuta Ogu ywa Bashani na wagomba nkondo wakwe, chiwakoma hasigale mntu yoyose. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Chitaha imizi yakwe yose, hahana hata mzi umwenga hechiutahile. Kwahamwenga chitaha mizi milongo mtandatu, kugamba ntendele yose ya Aligobu idya yendile ikalongozwa ni seuta Ogu ywa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Imizi yose iyo yendaga na viwambaza vitali, vyendaga na nchili na nyivi zina makomela. Naho kwendaga na kaya zilozize zendile hezi zungulukwe ni viwambaza. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Uko chibalanga chila chintu, chibalanga umzi na kukoma wagosi na wavyele na wana, saviya chidamanye mwemizi ya seuta Sihoni ywa Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Mna uludimo lose no ugoli chivitaha.”<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Umo chikataha isi iyo ya wadya amaseuta awaidi wa Waamoli wendaga wakekala ntendele ya kaidi yo umto wa Yolodani, mgati mo mto wa Alinoni no lugulu lwa Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Lugulu lwa Helimoni lwetangwa Silioni ni Wasidoni, na Waamoli walwitanga Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Chitaha imizi yose yentendele ye lubugabuga na zinukile naho ntendele yose ya Gileadi na Bashani yose kubula Saleka na Edilei, imizi ya seuta Ogu uko Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Seuta Ogu nuyodu asigalaga mwa Walefai. Lusazi lwakwe ludamanywa kwa chuma, chendaga na utali wa futi mlongo umwenga na mbili na uzangalamu wa futi mtandatu, saivyo vihimo vizwelwe. Lusazi ulo luchei uko komzi wa Waamoli wa Laba.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila yasigaila kwikala ulailo wa zuwa womto wa Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Eze chiiguhe isi iyo, siwenka makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi ntendele ya kukongela chenya mwa Aloeli haguhi na Alinoni, na inusu ye isi ya magulu ya Gileadi, hamwenga ne imizi yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Haheza niyo nawenka inusu ya awantu weidikabila dya Manase intendele isigale ya Gileadi hamwenga na Bashani yose yendile ikalongozwa ni Ogu, kugamba ntendele yose ya Aligobu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">Isi yose ya Bashani neimanyika kugamba ni isi ya Walefai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Yaili, ywa kabila dya Manase, aguhaga intendele yose ye isi ya Aligobu, ni kugamba Bashani, kubula momhaka wa Geshuli na Maaka. Izikaya zose kazinka idizina dyakwe, na kubula vino dyelo zimanyika saviya kaya za Hawoti Yaili.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Wantu wo lukolo lwa Makili wa kabila dya Manase, siwenka isi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Awantu wa amakabila ya Lubeni na Gadi siwenka isi yose kulaila Gileadi kubula komto wa Alinoni. Mhaka wawo wa kwa mwenyemzi wo mzi wendaga umto wa Alimoni na umhaka wa chenya wendaga umto wa Yaboki udya ukuhakana ne isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Ntendele ya uswelo wazuwa, isi yawo yenelaga kubula momto wa Yolodani. Kulaila mwe diziwa dya Galilaya ntendele ya chenya, ukaseleza kubula kwe bahali ya Alaba, ni kugamba Bahali yo Munyu, kubula kwe ziseleza za Pisiga, ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Chipindi icho nawenkaga amalagizo yano, ‘Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu Kawenkani isi ino ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mto wa Yolodani itende yenyu. Haluse nyuwe wagomba nkondo mgati mwa walukolo wenyu, guhani viziha mdeluke umto Yolodani mkatenda kulongozi kwa walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Mna wavyele wenyu na wanenyu na wanyama wenyu simanya mnaludimo lulozize nawekale mwe mizi niwenkileni. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Nyuwe wagomba nkondo wambizeni walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli kubula hadya Zumbe Chohile nawadahize wekale mwe isi aweikiye saviya nyuwe mwikale mpeho, kugamba saviya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, awenkileni uko ukajinka umto Yolodani. Mkaheza aho mwadaha kuya kweisi yenyu ino niwenkileni itende yenyu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Haheza simlagiza Yoshuwa, ‘Weye kuwona kwa meso yako mbuli zose ziya Zumbe, Chohile ywako, awatendele maseuta wano waidi, Sihoni na Ogu, ivyo, Zumbe Chohile nawatende seivyo amaseuta we izisi zose namjinkile. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Msekuwogoha kwaviya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, nuyo natowane kwa chausa chenyu.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa alemezwa kwingila Kananaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Chipindi icho simweila Zumbe hagamba, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Elo Zumbe dyetu, simanya kunilagisa miye mndima ywako nkongelo du yo ukulu wako no udahi wako. Togola, hana Chohile kwembingu hegu mwe isi akudaha kudamanya mbuli nkulu na za maula saviya udamanye weye! <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Nakulombeza nideluke umto wa Yolodani, niiwone isi yedi ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wo mto wa Yolodani, heye, isi yedi ikuwagila ya amagulu, hamwenga na amagulu ya Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Mna Zumbe Chohile anifilaga maya kwa chausa chenyu, hanitegeleze. Vyaleka, agamba, ‘Leka! Usekulonga vituhu imbuli ino. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kwela kubula kolunenengwe lo lugulu lwa Pisiga, ukaule vyedi ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa na chenya na kwamwenyemzi na ulailo wa zuwa na kwiwona isi iyo, mna weye haudeluke umto wa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Mna mjele moyo na kumtogeza Yoshuwa umlagize, kwaviya uyo nuyo nawalongoze awantu wano kudelukila ntendele ya kaidi yomto wa Yolidani, kwikala mweisi nauwone.’”<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Ivyo, chisigala mwedibwandasi kulongozi komzi wa Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Kutoza sigilizi za Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Mtozese malagizo na kutimila sigilizi zose huwahinyani, chani mdahe kuiguha isi idya Zumbe, Chohile ywa wababa zenyu, akuwenkani. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Msekongeza chochose mwa malagizo huwalagizani, naho msekuhunguza chintu, tozesani malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, yadya huwenkani. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwawonaga wenye mbuli ziya Zumbe Chohile amdamanyaga Baali Peoli. Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awakomaga wantu wose mgati mwenyu wamvikilaga mnungu akwitangwa Baali Peoli. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Mna nyuwe mtendile wakanuni kwa Zumbe Chihile, Chohile ywenyu mwiwajima kubula dyelo.” <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Kaulani! Siwahinyani milosi na malagizo saviya Zumbe, Chohile ywangu, anilagize nidamanye, chani myatoze mwe isi mkwita kuiguha na kuikala. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Tozani na kudamanya amalagizo ayo kwaviya mkadamanya ayo, wantu wa izisi ntuhu naho nawamanye kugamba nyuwe mwiwamanyi na wabala, wagambe, ‘Chindedi wantu we isi ino nkulu wana umanyi na ubala!’ ” <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Hahana si yoyose hata ikatenda nkulu vivihi, idya mnungu ywakwe ehaguhi nayo, saviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu ehaguhi na suwe, hadya chikamlombeza wambizi. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Naho hahana si ntuhu yoyose hata hegu ni nkulu vivihi, ina sigilizi na malagizo ya chindedi, saviya yadya niwahinyizeni mwe dizuwa dino dya dyelo.” <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Mna mkaulise mnase kujala mbuli ziya muwone wenye. Chani vinase kulaila hata nkanana imwe mo wikazi wenyu mbuli izo zikajalwa mwe myoyo yenyu. Watamuileni mbuli izo wanenyu na wezukulu wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />mwe idizuwa diya mwachimalaga kulongozi kwa Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, kudya Holebu, kugamba Sinai, akanigamba, ‘Wachisanyeni wantu awo kulongozi kwangu, niwagambile milosi yangu chani wahine kunivikila miye mazuwa yose yowikazi wawo, na kuwahinya wana wawo kudamanya ivyo.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Ivyo, mwasogelaga haguhi na kuchimala hasi ho lugulu ludya chipindi icho lwendaga lukaka moto ubwile kwembingu ukatenda ugubikwa ni ziza na ingu dizamile. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na nyuwe kulaila mgatigati mo moto uwo, mwevaga imilosi alongaga mna hamumwone ivyo eli, mwivadu idizwi dyakwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Uyo kawagambilani idilagano dyakwe akawalagiza mditoze, kugamba mtoze Sigilizi Mlongo ziya awandike mwe vibawo vidi vya mayuwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Mwe chipindi icho Zumbe Chohile anilagizaga niwahinyeni sigilizi na malagizo yose yadya mkungwa mdamanye mwe isi idya mkwita kuiguha na kuikala.”<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiko mwe kuvikila matukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Elo, msinyise mnase kujala kugamba, Zumbe hadya alongaga na nyuwe kudya ko lugulu lwa Holebu mgatigati mo moto hamumuwone ivyo eli. Ivyo, mkaulisi, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />msekukola masa kwa kwedamanyiza matukulu yoyose ya kusongola, hegu ya sula hegu mliganyo wowose, mliganyo wa mgosi hegu mvyele, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ywa mnyama yoyose mweisi hegu kadege koulanga, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />hegu mliganyo wa mnyama akutambala mwesanga hegu wa samaki mwa mazi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Mkaulise chani chipindi namkaule zuwa na mnenge na ntondo na vintu vyose vya koulanga mnase kuluvywa na kuvivikila na kuvisankanila, kwaviya vintu ivyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu avyumbaga kwachausa cha wantu wose mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Mna nyuwe ni nyuwe wantu awakomboleni kulaila mweisi ya Misili mwe tanuli dya chuma. Kawalavyani uko chani mtende wantu wakwe saviya vino mwili vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Kwa chausa chenyu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, anifilaga maya, niyo elisa kugamba miye sanideluke umto wa Yolodani kwingila mwe isi idya yedi akuwenkani itende ugoli wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Miye nanibanikile mwe isi ino naho sanideluke umto, mna nyuwe mwi haguhi na kudeluka na kwita kuiguha na kuikala mwe isi idya yedi. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Msinyise mnase kujala lagano diya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, adamanye na nyuwe. Msekwedamanyiza tukulu dya kusongola mwe sula ya chintu chochose chiya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awalemezeni kumliganya nacho, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ni moto ukutikimya. Uyo ni Chohile mta wivu.” <verse eid="DEU 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Umo mkatenda mwikala mwe isi iyo, mweleka wana na kutenda na wezukulu na kutenda wadalahala, uneva mnakonga kukola masa na kwedamanyiza tukulu dya kusongola mwe sula ya chintu chochose, mkadamanya ubanasi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kumjela maya, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />ivyo, miye dyelo nazitanga izimbingu ne isi ziwone mgati mwenyu, nawagambilani kugamba nkanana imwenga nambalangwe vitendese mwe isi iyo mkwita kwikala uko ntendelele ya kaidi youmto wa Yolidani. Hamwikale uko kwa chipindi chitali, mna na mkomwe vitendese. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Zumbe Chohile nawamwaganiseni mgati mwe wantu wa izisi ntuhu, niwajeche mwenyu du nawasigale uko Zumbe Chohile nawabalazizeni. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Uko namsankanile milungu ya miti na mayuwe iyo idamanywe kwa mikono ya wantu, heikudaha kuwona, naho heikwiva, haikudya hegu kunusa. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Akaheza kulaila umo mwe isi namumlonde Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nanywi namumpate uneva mnamlonda kwa moyo wose na muye wose. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Mbuli zino zose umo naziwabwileni uko nyumani, mnabwilwa ni nkunto, namumuwiye Zumbe Chohile na kumwiva. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ni Chohile mta mbazi, hawalekeni hegu kuwakomani, hegu kujala lagano adamanyaga na wakale wenyu kwa cheliso.” <verse eid="DEU 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Fanyanyisani mwe mbuli zalailaga chikale, zalailaga umo hemnati kwelekwa, kukongela zuwa diya Chohile aumbaga mntu mwe isi. Uzani mwe isi yose, kulaila ntendele imwenga kubula ntuhu, hegu kwalailaga mbuli ya maula saino hegu kwivika! <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Togola wantu wevaga izwi dya Chohile dikalonga kulaila mgatigati mwe moto, saviya nyuwe mwivile, niyo wasigala wajima? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Togola hana Chohile yoyose mtuhu ajezaga hata hadodo kwita kweguhila wantu wakwe kulaila mwe wantu wa si ntuhu, saviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, adamanye, kwa kujeseza majezo, vilagiso, maula, nkondo na kwanguvu yakwe nkulu, niyo ahosa mbuli zakutisa ziya nyuwe muwone kudya Misili? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Nyuwe mwawonaga wenye izimbuli izo, chani mbunkule kugamba Zumbe nuyo Chohile echedu naho hahana mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Kawatendani mwive idizwi dyakwe kulaila kwembingu chani adahe kuwahinyani na hano heisi kawatenda muwone umoto wakwe mkulu na kwiva milosi yakwe kulaila mgatigati mo umoto uwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kwaviya nakawaunga wakale wenyu, uyo kawasagulani nyuwe welekwa wawo, niyo awalavyani mwenye mwe isi ya Misili kwa nguvu yakwe nkulu. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Awabalazaga kulongozi kwenyu wantu we izisi nkulu wana nguvu kujinka nyuwe, chani awegaleni na kuwenkani isi yawo itende ulisi wenyu, saviya vili kubula dyelo! <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Ivyo, dyelo kumbukani na kwika mwe myoyo yenyu, kugamba Zumbe Chohile nuyo Chohile kwembingu na hasi he isi, hahana mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Ivyo mtoze malagizo yakwe na sigilizi zakwe ziya huwenkani dyelo chani mchumilwe, nyuwe hamwenga na welekwa wenyu, na kwikala mazuwa yalozize mwe isi idya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani itende yenyu mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi ya kusumkila ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Naho Musa asentile mizi mitatu ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa woumto wa Yolodani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />umo mntu akudaha kusumkila na kwehonya, hegu kakoma mntu suyo mnkondo ywakwe hekambile. Mntu sauyo adaha kusumkila mwe mzi umwenga na kwehonya ujima wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Kasenta umzi wa Beseli mwedibwandasi dye dijangwa kwa chausa che dikabila dya Lubeni na mzi wa Lamoli mwe isi ya Gileadi kwa chausa che dikabila dya Gadi na mzi wa Golani mwe isi ya Bashani kwa chausa che dikabila dya Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa sigilizi ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ino niyo isigilizi Musa awenkile Waizulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ino niyo imilosi na malagizo na sigilizi ziya Musa awagambile Waizulaeli umo wakalaila Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />wakatenda ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo umto wa Yolodani, mwedibwandasi dikulongozi komzi ukwitangwa Beti Peoli, mwe isi yendaga ya seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli, alongozaga kulaila mo mzi wa Heziboni, yudya Musa na Waizulaeli wamhudaga wakalaila Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Watahakaga isi yakwe ne isi ya seuta Ogu ywa Bashani. Maseuta awo waidi wa Waamoli walongozaga uko ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo umto Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Isi iyo yenelaga kulaila Aloeli mo lujevu lwo umto Alinoni, kubula mo lugulu lwa Silioni, kugamba Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />hamwenga ne ntendele yose ya ulailo wa zuwa wo umto wa Yolodani kubula kwe Bahali Imunyu, kwa kumpezo kwe seleza yo lugulu lwa Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo Mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa kawetanga hamwenga Waizulaeli, nakuwagamba, “Nyuwe Waizulaeli, tegelezani sigilizi na malagizo yadya hulonga kulongozi kwenyu dyelo. Mhine ayo na kuyatoza kwa kukaulisa. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, adamanyaga lagano na suwe kolugulu lwa Holebu iviya lwetangwa Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Hadamanye lagano na wakale wetu du, mna kadamanya na suwe chose chichei wajima kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Zumbe Chohile alosanaga na nyuwe mlomo kwa mlomo uko kolugulu mgati mo moto. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Chipindi icho miye nendaga mlosi mwenyu na Zumbe Chohile, siwagambilani yadya alongile, kwaviya nyuwe mogohaga udya umoto hamkweile kulanga kolugulu. Zumbe Chohile niyo agamba vino, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />Miye ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, hulavize mwe isi ya Misili, kudya wendile wimtumwa.” <verse eid="DEU 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Usekuvikila milungu mituhu mna miye du.” <verse eid="DEU 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Usekwedamanyiza matukulu ya milungu ya kusongola, hegu mliganyo wa chintu chochose chi kulanga kwembingu, hegu chi hasi he isi, hegu chi mwa mazi hasi heisi. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Usekuvikila hegu kuvisankanila, kwaviya miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, ni Chohile mta wivu. Nawakantila wana wihi wa watati zawo, hata cheleko cha katatu na cha kane cha wadya wakunihiwa. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Mna nawadamanyiza yedi magana kwa magana wadya wakununga na kutoza izisigilizi zangu. <verse eid="DEU 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“Usekudilonga vya bule idizina dyangu miye Zumbe Chohile ywako, kwaviya miye sanileke kumkantila mntu yoyose akudamanya ivyo. <verse eid="DEU 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Toza Zuwa dya kuhumula na kuikukiza, saviya miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, hulagize. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Damanya ndima na mbuli zako zose kwa mazuwa mtandatu. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya kuhumula disentwa kwachausa changu. Mweidizuwa idyo usekudamanya ndima yoyose, weye hegu mwanawo, hegu mchiche ywako, hegu mtumwa ywako, hegu mndima ywako ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche, hegu ng'ombe yako, hegu mpunda yako, hegu mnyama ywako yoyose, hegu mjeni emnyumba mwako, chani mtumwa ywako na mndima ywako wahumule seviya weye. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Usekujala kugamba weye wendaga mtumwa mwe isi ya Misili, miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, sikulavya uko kwa udahi mkulu na mkono uchuluswe, nivyo vikuleka miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, sigulagiza utoze Zuwa dya kuhumula.” <verse eid="DEU 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“Watunye tati yako na mami yako, saviya miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako hulagize, damanya ivyo chani wikale mazuwa yalozize na kuchumilwa mwe isi idya hukwinka.” <verse eid="DEU 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“Usekukoma.” <verse eid="DEU 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“Usekujenda uyaga.” <verse eid="DEU 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“Usekubawa.” <verse eid="DEU 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“Usekulonga ukuzi wa udanti mwa mnyawo.” <verse eid="DEU 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“Usekummeila mate mkaza mnyawo, hegu nyumba yakwe, hegu nkonde yakwe, hegu mtumwa ywakwe ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche, hegu ng'ombe hegu mpunda, hegu chintu chochose ananacho mnyawo.” <verse eid="DEU 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Zino nizo izisigilizi Zumbe Chohile awagambileni nyose kwa izwi kulu kulaila mo moto na diya idingu dizamile na ziza ditendese. Awagambilagani umo mwendile mdugana kolugulu, naho hongezeze sigiizi ntuhu. Akaheza niyo aziwandika mlanga mwe vibawo vidi vya mayuwe, niyo aninka.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkama ya wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Eze mwize idizwi idyo kulaila mgati mwe diya idiziza, kulanga kwa ludya ulugulu lwendile lukaka moto, vilongozi wose wa makabila na wakale wenyu wanibasaga, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />wakagamba, ‘Tegeleza! Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, kachigubwila ung'azi na ukulu wakwe. Chiva idizwi dyakwe kulaila mgati mo udya umoto. Dyelo dino chimwona Chohile akalonga na mntu, mntu uyo habanike kajendeleza kwikala! <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Mna nimbwani kwejela mwe mbuli ya kukomwa kwa kokwa ni udya umoto mkulu? Chineva vituhu izwi dya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu nachibanike. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Togola ni mntu yuhi evaga izwi dya Chohile mta ujima kulaila mgati mwe moto saviya suwe chimwivile na kusigala mjima? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Viwagila weye Musa wite haguhi, ukategeleze mbuli zose Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu nalonge, suwe nachizetegeleze na kuzidamanya.’” <verse eid="DEU 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Zumbe Chohile evaga imilosi yenyu mnigambile, niyo anigamba, ‘Siva imilosi yose wakugambile awantu wano, vyose walongile ni vyedi. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Hegu watendile na moyo sauwo wakanitunya na kutoza malagizo yangu mazuwa yose! Mbuli zawo zose naziwachumula, wowo wenye na welekwa wawo mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Hita ukawagambe awantu wauye kwa amahema yawo. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Mna weye, Musa, chimala hano haguhi na miye, nahugambile malagizo yose na sigilizi zangu, ukunga uwahinye, chani isi idya huwenka itende yawo.’” <verse eid="DEU 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Nyuwe msinyise saviya Zumbe Chohile awalagizeni, damanyani chila chintu jejeje. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Tongelani sila yose Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awalagize kuitimila chani mbuli zenyu ziwachumileni na mwikale chipindi chitali mwe isi namguhe itende yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Lagizo Kulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Zino ni sigilizi na miko na malagizo yadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, anilagize niwahinyeni, chani mdamanye mwe isi mkwita kuiguha na kuikala. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Chipindi chose mwi wajima, mwaungwa mumvikile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kutoza sigilizi zose na malagizo huwenkani nyuwe na welekwa wenyu chani mwikale wikazi mtali. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Kwaivyo nyuwe Waizulaeli, mkaulise kuyadamanya ayo, chani mdahe kujenyela vitendese mwe isi iyo ikuwagila kulima na kudimila saviya Zumbe Chohile ywa wababa zenyu alagane.” <verse eid="DEU 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Ivyo tegelezani nyuwe Waizulaeli! Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ni Zumbe Chohile echedu. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Muungeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa moyo wose, na kwa muye wose na kwa nguvu zenyu zose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Msekujala kudamanya yano malagizo huwenkani vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Wahinyiseni wanenyu. Watamwileni umo mkatenda mwikala mnyumba hegu umo mkajenda hegu umo mkagona na aho mkwinukila. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Yawandikeni mwemikono yenyu na mwemitwi yenyu yatende saviya lukumbusa. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Yawandikeni mwe mimo ye zinyivi zenyu na mwezinchili ze imizi yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanyo kwa wantu hewekwiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Saviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awelisize wababa zenyu, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, uyo nawenkeni isi ina mizi mikulu na mitana ikuwagila idya nyuwe hemuizengile. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Nyumba nazitende zimema vintu vitana nyuwe hemwivikiye, nakutende na masima yadya nyuwe hemyasimbile na nkonde za mizabibu na mizaituni idya nyuwe hemwihandile. Hadya Zumbe Chohile nawegaleni kwe isi iyo uko namtende na nkande yoyose namunge, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />msinyise kugamba hamkumjala Zumbe Chohile awalavize kulaila Misili kudya mwendile watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, namumvikile uyodu na kwelisa mwe zina dyakwe idyodu. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Msekuvikila milungu mituhu, milungu ya wantu wehaguhi na nyuwe, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />chani maya ya Zumbe Chohile yanasekuwemukilani, uyo anasekuwakoma mwe isi, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ehagati henyu, ni Chohile mta wivu.” <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Msekumjeza Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, saviya mumjezize kudya Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Tozani sigilizi zose na malagizo ne miko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ziya awalagizeni. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Damanyani yadya yakumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, chani mdahe kuchumilwa, mdahe kwikala mwe isi yedi idya Zumbe Chohile alisaga kuwenka wababa zenyu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />nakugamba Zumbe Chohile nawabalaze wankondo wenyu saviya Zumbe alongaga.” <verse eid="DEU 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Mazuwa yakwiza, wana wenyu wanawauza, ‘Kwambwani Zumbe Chohile ywetu kachilagiza chitoze sigilizi na magizo yano yose?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Nyuwe namuwahitule vino, ‘Suwe chendaga watumwa wa seuta ywa Misili, Zumbe Chohile niyo achikombola kwa udahi wakwe mkulu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Kwa meso yetu wenye chamuwonaga akadamanya mpituko na maula na mbuli zikutisa mwa Wamisili, seuta ywawo na masekulu wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Kachilavya Misili, kachigala hano na kuchinka isi ino, saviya elisize kugamba nawenke wababa zetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile kachilagiza kutoza sigilizi zino zose na kumvikila kwa kuchumilwa kwetu wenye, chani achidime kale na kale savino vili vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Nachitende chawagila kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, umo chinatoza amalagizo yakwe saviya achilagize.’”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wasagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawabuze kwe isi idya mkwita kutenda wikazi wenyu nawabalaze wantu walozize kulaila mwe isi iyo wantu wa si nkulu mfungate za Wahiti na Wagiligasi na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wapelezi na Wahivi na Wayebusi, wana nguvu kujinka nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Iviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, aho nawenkeni udahi mwawo na kuwahuda awantu awo na kuwakoma vitendese, msekwika lagano dyodyose nawo hegu kuwafila mbazi. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Msekusolana nawo, hegu kuwaloza wachiche wenyu hegu wanenyu wasekusola kwawo. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Mnadamanya ivyo wowo nawawazaganye wanenyu wasekumtimila Zumbe Chohile na kuvikila milungu mituhu. Uneva ivyo vinalaila, Zumbe Chohile nawehiweni na kuwatenda wavikile milungu mituhu, na maya ya Zumbe Chohile nayawemukile, vikaheza nasunguze kuwakomani. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Mna wadamanyeni vino, Tulani izinchanja zawo zo kulaviza ntambiko na kutula izinguzo zawo. Matukulu yawo yokusongola ya Ashela namyatikimye. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Mdamanye ivyo kwaviya nyuwe msentwa kwachausa cha Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenu. Wantu wose mwe isi kawasagulani nyuwe chani mtende wantu wakwe mwenye.” <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Zumbe Chohile hawaungileni nyuwe na kuwasagulani kwaviya nyuwe mlozesa kujinka wantu watuhu, nyuwe mwendaga wajeche kujinka wantu watuhu mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Mna ni kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awaungani naho atoza cheliso awelisize wababa zenyu, nivyo vikuleka kawakombolani kwa udahi wakwe mkulu na kuwalavyani mo utumwa wa Falao seuta ywa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Ivyo, mmanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nuyo Chohile. Ni Chohile mkanuni, akutoza lagano dyakwe na kudamanya yedi kwa vyeleko vilozize vya wadya wakumunga na kutoza sigilizi zakwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Mna awalihiza viya vikungwa wadya wakumwihiwa. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Ivyo kaulisani kutoza isigilizi ne miko na malagizo huwenkani vino dyelo.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujimbiko wa wantu wakwiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Mnetegeleza amalagizo yano na kuyatoza na kuyadamanya, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, natoze lagano dyakwe na nyuwe nawadamanyizeni yedi saviya awagambilaga wababa zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Nawaunge na kuwajimbika, nanywi namjenyele na kutenda na lweleko lulozize, najimbike izinkonde zenyu chani mpate nkande na divai na mavuta, nawajimbikeni kwa kuwenkani ng'ombe na ngoto zilozize mwe isi alagane na wababa zenyu kugamba nawenkeni nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Namjimbikwe kujinka wantu wose mwe izisi zose. Mgati mwenyu hakutende na mgosi hegu mvyele hekweleka, na wanyama wenyu wo ludimo hawaswese wana. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Zumbe Chohile nawausizeni manyonje yose naho hamwingilwe ni manyonje yoyose ya kutisa saviya ya Wamisili, mna nawenke awankondo wenyu amanyonje ayo. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Wakomeni awantu awo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawenkeni uhuda mwawo, naho msekuwafila mbazi. Msekuvikila milungu yawo, kwaviya mbuli ino naitende mtego mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Msekwelongela mwe myoyo yenyu, ‘Wantu wano waloza kujinka suwe, chadaha vivihi kuwabalaza kulaila mwe isi?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Msekuwogoha, kumbukani viya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, amdamanyaga Falao seuta ywa Misili na awantu wakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Kumbukani nkomano zikulise muwone wenye na mpituko na maula na nguvu nkulu na udahi mkulu udya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu ajeseze kuwakombolani, ivyo nivyo nawadamanyize awantu awo mkuwogoha. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Kujinka ayo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, negale mwituso mgati mwawo na kuwakoma wadya wendile wakasumka na kwefisa. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ivyo, msekuwogoha, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, emgati mwenyu. Uyo ni Chohile mkulu naho ogofya. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nabalaze awantu awo kuligana naviya mkujendeleza kulongozi hadododo. Hamdahe kuwakoma wose kwa nkanana imwenga, kwaviya mnatenda ivyo makala ya kumbago nayejenyele na kuwambaza ujima wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawenkeni uhuda mwa awankondo wenyu na kuwatenda wangadike kubula wasile kubanike. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Nawenkeni uhuda mwa amaseuta wawo. Namuwakome, nawo nawajalwe. Hahana mntu yoyose nadahe kuwachindani, kubula aho namuwabinde kuwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Yatikimyeni amatukulu yawo yo kusongola nemilungu yawo. Msekumeila mate chumbu chawo hegu zahabu yawo, naho msekuiguha na kutenda ugoli wenyu. Mnatenda ivyo naitende ni mtego mwenyu naho ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Msekwigala matukulu mwezinyumba zenyu, mnadamanya ivyo namligitwe saviya amatukulu ayo. Myaihiwe na kuyabela kwaviya ni vintu viligitwe ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Si yedi yakutaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Miko yose huwenkani vino dyelo, mwaungwa mwitozese kwa ukanuni chani mdahe kwikala na kujenyela, na mdahe kwingila na kwikaila isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, elisaga kuwenka wababa zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Mkumbuke viya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awalongozeni mwe ntambo ntali kujinkila kwedijangwa kwa chipindi che mihilimo iyo milongo mine, chani kawanyanyahazanina na kuwajezani chani amanye yadya mwendile mkafanyanya mwe myoyo yenyu, hegu na mtoza imiko yakwe hegu bule. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Kawanyanyahazani, niyo awalekani mlumwe nisala na nyumani kaweni nkande ikwitangwa mana mdye, nkande idya hamwaimanyaga, hegu wababa zenyu hawaimanyaga. Kadamanya ivyo chani atende awahinye kugamba mntu hakudaha kwikala kwa mgate uwodu, mna kwa chila akulonga Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mwechipindi icho che mihilimo milongo mine suche zenyu hazisakale, naho iviga vyenyu havivimbile. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Kumbukani kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awafundani saviya tati ya mntu akumfunda mwanawe. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Ivyo, tozani imiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mdahe kutimila izisila zakwe na kumtunya uyodu. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awegalani mwe isi yedi, isi ina mito na sokwe, na mazi yakuvaja kulaila mwamabwandasi na magulu, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />si ina ngano na shaili, mizabibu na mitini na mikomamanga na mavuta ya mizeituni na uchi. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Uko nampate nkande ilozize naho hamhungukilwe ni chintu. Mayuwe yakwe yana chuma, na mwa magulu yakwe mwadaha msimbe shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Namdye na kwiguta, namumtogole Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa si yedi awenkileni.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanyo mwe kumjala Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Musa ajendeleza kulonga “Mkaulise kugamba hamumjale Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa kuleka kutoza izisigilizi zakwe, malagizo yakwe ne imiko yakwe ino huwalagizani vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Mkaheza kudya na kwiguta, na kuzenga nyumba zedi na kwikala umo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />na chipindi hadya izing'ombe zenyu ne zingoto zenyu, zahabu na mayuwe yenyu ye chumbu, na chila chintu mnanacho nachitende nachongezekele, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />msekutenda na wefenyi na kumjala Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awalavizeni mwe isi ya Misili, hantu mwendaga watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Nuyo awalongozeni mwedijangwa diya idikulu dikutisa, dina nyoka zina sumu na visuse, mwe isi idya ikalagale heina mazi, awalavizagani mazi kulaila mwe luwe lutogile. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Naho nuyo awalisizeni nkande ikwitangwa mana mwe dijangwa, nkande idya wababa zenyu hawaimanyaga. Adamanyaga ayo yose chani awanyanyahazeni na kuwajeza, chani awahimeni adahe kuwadamanyizani yedi mo udumo. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Ivyo mkaulise chani mnasekwelongela mwe myoyo yenyu, ‘Chepatila wagoli kwa udahi wetu na nguvu zetu wenye.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Kumbukani kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nuyo akuwenkani udahi wa kuwatendani wagoli. Adamanya ivyo chani achintize Idilagano adamanye na wababa zenyu kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Mna mnamjala Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kuitimila milungu mituhu chani kuisankanila na kuivikila, nawafundisani vino dyelo kugamba chindedi namsilise kubanika. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Hamna mwetegeleze Zumbe Chohile, namsile saviya wantu wa si ntuhu akuwakoma kulongozi kwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka kutoza malagizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Tegelezani nyuwe Waizulaeli! Vino dyelo mwihaguhi kudeluka umto wa Yolodani, kwita kwikala mwe si nkulu za wantu wata nguvu kujinka nyuwe. Imizi yawo ni mikulu naho ina viwambaza vikubula kwa maingu. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Wantu wenye ni watali na wata nguvu, ni Waanaki wadya saviya mmanyize na saviya mwivile wantu wakulonga mwawo, ‘Niyuhi akudaha kuhigana nawo?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Mvimanye vino dyelo kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu akuwalongwelani saviya moto ukutikimywa. Uyo nawakome awo na kuwahuda kulongozi kwenyu, ivyo namuwabalaze na kuwakoma lumwengadu, saviya Zumbe Chohile alagane.” <verse eid="DEU 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akaheza kuwabalaza awantu awo kulongozi kwenyu, mnase kwelongela wenye kugamba, ‘Ni kwa chausa cha ntendwa zetu zedi, Zumbe Chohile kachigala chikale mwe isi ino,’ mna kwachausa cha ubanasi wa awantu awo nivyo vilekile akawabalaza kulongozi kwetu. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Mwadaha kwikala mwe isi yawo siyo kwaviya nyuwe mwi wantu wedi hegu ni wata myoyo yedi, mna Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kawabalaza awantu awo kulongozi kwenyu kwaviya ni wabanasi na kwa kuchintiza udya ulosi awelisize wababa zenyu, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Ivyo, mmanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awenkani isi ino yedi mwikale, siyo kugamba mwawagila, kwaviya nyuwe mwi wadala wa kwiva.” <verse eid="DEU 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Kumbukani naho msekujala viya wakale wenyu wamwihize Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kudya kwe dijamngwa. Kukongela mwedizuwa diya mlaile mwe isi ya Misili kubula mwedizuwa mbwile ahantu hano, nyuwe na mkamwihiza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Hata uko kolugulu lwa Holebu iviya lwetangwa Sinai namumjela maya Zumbe Chohile, uyo amukisagwa ni maya, nakaunga awakomeni. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Eze nikwele kolugulu kokuhokela ivibawo vya mayuwe viya viwandikwe idilagano diya Zumbe Chohile alagane na nyuwe, sikala uko mazuwa milongo mine, chilo na msi, sidile hegu kunywa chintu chochose. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo aninka vibawo vidi vya mayuwe viwandikwe kwa dole dyakwe, vyendaga viwandikwa milosi yose idya Zumbe Chohile awagambilagani kolugulu kulaila mo moto mwedizuwa dyo mdugano. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Eze yomboke amazuwa ayo milongo mine, chilo na msi, Zumbe Chohile niyo aninka ivibawo ivyo ividi vya mayuwe viya viwandikwe idilagano.” <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, ‘Halawe, sunguza usele hasi kolugulu, kwaviya awantu wako uwalavize Misili wabalanga. Waleka kale isila niwalagize waitimile walujula zahabu na kwedamanyiza tukulu.’” <verse eid="DEU 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Ivyodu, Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, Siwawona wano ni wantu wadala wa kwiva vitendese, <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />nileka niwakome, nuse idizina dyawo kulaila mwe isi, miye nahutende weye utende tati ywa wantu walozese wana udahi utendese kujinka wowo. <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Ivyo, niyo nahituka, nasela kulaila kolugulu, hatenda sinula viya ivibawo ividi vya mayuwe vye dilagano, moto nendile ukaka kulanga kolugulu. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Sikaula, niyo nehelwa kuwona kugamba mheza kukola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Mwedamanyiza tukulu dya ndama ya kulujula, msunguza kuileka isila ya Zumbe Chohile idya awalagizeni. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ivyo, nasivitoza viya ivibawo ividi niyo navidula hasi, na kuvitula kulongozi kwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Haheza niyo nagwa chifudifudi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, kwa mazuwa milongo mine sidile nkande hegu kunywa mazi saviya nkongo, kwachausa cha masa mdamanye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kumjela maya. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Kwaviya nasogoha maya ya Zumbe Chohile mwenyu na kwekamba kuwakomani, mna iviya Zumbe Chohile kaniva amalombezo yangu mwe chipindi icho. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Iviya Zumbe Chohile nakamfila maya Haluni vilekile nakaunga amkome, ivyo niyo namlombezeza Haluni mwe chipindi icho iviya Zumbe niyo aniva. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Yadya amasa yenyu, kugamba idya indama mwedamanyize, siiguha naidula mo moto, niyo naihonda na kuisagantiza yatenda lumbi didinyike, haheza niyo netila idilumbi idyo momto ukujuluzika hasi ho lugulu ulo.” <verse eid="DEU 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Iviya mumjela maya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, uko Tabela Masa na Kibuloti Hatava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Umo Zumbe Chohile eze awasigileni kulaila Kadeshi Balineya, akagamba ‘Hitani mkekale mwe isi idya niwenkileni,’ mumhiga, hamumzumile hegu kutimila yadya awagambileni. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Nyuwe mwi wata kumhiga Zumbe Chohile kukongela zuwa niwamanyizeni.” <verse eid="DEU 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Ivyo, sigwa chifudifudi hasi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile mazuwa ayo milongo mine, chilo na msi, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nakagamba nawakomeni. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Simlombeza Zumbe Chohile hagamba. ‘Weye Zumbe Chohile, usekuwakoma awantu wako na ulisi wako, wantu ukombole na kuwalavya mwe isi ya Misili kwa udahi na nguvu yako nkulu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Wakumbuke awandima wako, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, naho usekukaula uhigi na wihi na masa ya wano wantu. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Wantu wa Misili kudya uchilavize wanase kugamba, Zumbe Chohile kawalavya chani akawakome kwedijangwa kwaviya hadahile kuwengiza mwe isi alagane naho kwaviya kawafila maya. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Kwaviya, wano ni wantu wako na ulisi wako, wantu ulavize kulaila Misili kwa nguvu na udahi wako mkulu.’”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa ahokela sigilizi vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Akaheza Zumbe niyo anigamba, ‘Songola vibawo vidi vya mayuwe saviya vya nkongo, na shanduku dya mbawo dya kuvikiya, ukajika vize kwangu kuno kulanga kolugulu, <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />nami naniwandike imilosi yendile iwandikwa mwe ivibawo viya utwile, ukaheza vike ivibawo ivyo mwe dishanduku.’” <verse eid="DEU 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Ivyo, niyo nadamanya shanduku dya mbawo za mti ukwitangwa mshita na vibawo vidi vya mayuwe saviya vya nkongo, na kuviguha mwe mikono, niyo nakwela navyo kolugulu. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awandika mwe vibawo ivyo milosi saidya ya nkongo, sigilizi mlongo ziya awenkagani hadya alongaga kulaila mo moto zuwa dyo mdugano. Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo aninka ivibawo ivyo, <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />niyo nahituka, nasela kulaila kolugulu, saviya nilagizwe ni Zumbe Chohile, sivika ivibawo ivyo mndani mwe dishanduku nadamanye, saviya anilagize Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="DEU 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />(Wantu wa Izulaeli watamba kulaila mwa amasima ya wantu wa Yakani kubula Mosela. Aho, Haluni niyo abanika na kuhambwa uko. Mwanawe Eleazali niyo aguha ahantu hakwe atenda mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kulaila aho, watamba kubula Gudigoda kulaila Gudigoda kubula Yotibata, ntendele ina mito ilozize ya mazi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Chipindi icho, Zumbe Chohile kawasagula wantu we idikabila dya Lawi watende wadihagata idishanduku dye Dilagano dya Zumbe Chohile, wamsankanile saviya walavyantambiko na kujimbika wantu kwa zina dyakwe kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Nivyo vikuleka wantu we idikabila dya Lawi hawana hantu heulisi mwe isi hamwenga na walukolo wawo, icho wahokele ni ntunyo ya kutenda walavyantambiko wa Zumbe Chohile, saviya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, alongile. <verse eid="DEU 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga “Sikala kolugulu mazuwa milongo mine, chilo na msi, saviya nkongo. Zumbe Chohile kanetegeleza kwa nkanana ntuhu na kuzumila asekuwakomani. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Niyo anigamba, ‘Halawe jendeleze ne ntambo yako walongoze wantu chani wadahe kwingila na kwikala mwe isi niwelisize wababa zenyu kugamba naniwenkeni.’”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Icho akunga Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Haluse, nyuwe Waizulaeli, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu icho akunga kwenyu ni kumvikila uyo, kutimila izisila zakwe zose, kumunga, kumsankanila Zumbe kwa myoyo yenyu yose na kwa myuye yenyu yose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />na kutimila miko yakwe na malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile huwenkani dyelo, kwa kuchumilwa kwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Kaula, imbingu yose ni ugoli wa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, isi ne ivintu vyose viyumo. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Naho Zumbe Chohile nakawaunga wababa zenyu chindedindedi kawasagulani nyuwe welekwa wawo ukaleka wantu watuhu wose, saviya vili vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Ivyo, kukongela haluse mtunyeni Zumbe, msekutenda wankani vituhu. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nuyo Chohile ywa milungu na Zumbe dya mazumbe. Uyo ni Chohile mkulu na mta nguvu, na ywakogofya, hakuhingiza naho hakuhokela hongo. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Awenka vikuwagila wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo, naho aunga wajeni na kuwenka nkande na suche. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Ivyo, nyuwe waungeni wajeni, kwaviya namwiwajeni mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mvikilenile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, msankanileni, mtimileni na kwelisa kwa zina dyakwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Uyo nuyo chinyemi chenyu, nuyo Chohile ywenyu awadamanyizeni mbuli zino nkulu zikutisa mziwone wenye. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Wababa zenyu weze waite Misili, wendaga milongo mfungate du, mna haluse Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kawatendani mlozesa saviya ntondo mo ulanga.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Kwa chausa icho, mungeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kutoza sigilizi zakwe mazuwa yose, na malagizo yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Fanyanyisani, kwaviya dyelo sikulonga na wanenyu wadya hawamanyaga hegu hawawonaga kanto dya Zumbe Chohile na udahi wakwe nezinguvu zakwe, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />vilagiso vyakwe na maula yakwe amdamanyize seuta ywa Misili na wantu wakwe yose. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Muwona ivyo awadamanye awankondo wa Misili, izifalasi zawo, na myutuka yawo ye nkondo, neivyo awadidimize awankondo awo mwe Bahali ya Shamu, neivyo Zumbe Chohile adikomile kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Naho mkumbuke ivyo Zumbe Chohile awadamanyizeni kwe dijangwa hemwinati kubula hano, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />na mbuli awadamanye wakina Dasani na Abilamu, wana wa Eliabu, ywedikabila dya Lubeni. Viya isi igubuke na kuwamela wantu wose hamwenga nezinkolo zawo na amahema yawo, wanyama na wandima wawo wose kulongozi kwa wantu wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Chindedi muwona wenye izimbuli zose nkulu Zumbe Chohile adamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujimbiko we isi weikiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Tozani malagizo yose huwalagizani vino dyelo, chani mdahe kwingila na kwikala mwe isi idya mkubasa, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />mdahe kwikala chipindi chitali mwe isi iyo ikuwagila kulima na kudimila, si idya Zumbe Chohile alagane kuwenka wababa zenyu na welekwa wawo. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Kwaviya isi mkwita kwikala siyo saidya ya Misili mlaile, kudya mwahandile mbeyu, mkanyweseza mazi kwa kuhikiliza saviya nkonde za mboga. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Mna isi mkwita kwikala ni si ya magulu na makolongo, isi idya ikunyelwa ni fula kulaila kwembingu, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, aikwitunduliya, Zumbe Chohile aidima kale na kale kukonge nkongelo ya mhilimo kubula udumo wa mhilimo.” <verse eid="DEU 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Ivyo, mkatoza imiko yangu huwenkani vino dyelo, mkamunga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mkamsankanila kwa myoyo yenyu yose na myuye yenyu yose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />uyo na wenkeni fula kwa chipindi chakwe, fula za masika na fula za vuli, nyuwe nanywi na mlozole nkande zenyu, na divai zenyu na mavuta yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Nahoteze mani mwe zinkonde zenyu kwa chausa che zing'ombe zenyu, nanywi namdye na kwiguta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mkaulise, imyoyo yenyu inase kudantwa, niyo mwahitukila milungu mituhu na kuivikila, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />vinase kuleka Zumbe Chohile akawafilani maya, niyo achinda izimbingu fula isekunya neisi isekutenda na ulozo wakwe, vikaheza mwasunguza kubanika, hata hegu ni si yedi idya Zumbe Chohile akuwenkani.” <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Wikeni ulosi wangu uno mwe myoyo yenyu, na mwe myuye yenyu. Muuanyinye mwemikono yenyu na mwevinengo vyenyu itende chilagiso cha lukumbusa. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Wahinyeni wanenyu imilosi ino mkaitamwila hadya mkatenda mwikala mwezinyumba zenyu, na hadya mkajenda, na hadya mkagona na hadya mkwinukila. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Yawandikeni mwe mimo ye zinyivi ze zinyumba zenyu, na mwe zinchili ze imizi yenyu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />saviya izimbingu zikwikala mlanga mwe isi mazuwa yose, chani nyuwe na wanenyu mwikale wikazi mtali mwe isi idya Zumbe Chihile, Chohile ywenyu, elisaga kuwenka wababa zenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Uneva mkedima kudamanya izisigilizi zose ziya niwenkileni, kumunga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kuzitimila izisila zakwe zose na kumtimila, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />ivyo, Zumbe Chohile nawabalaze wantu wa si zose ntuhu kulongozi kwenyu, nyuwe nanywi namwikale mwe isi izo zina wantu wata nguvu kujinka nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Chila hantu namjate nahatende henyu, isi yenyu nayenele kulaila mwe dijangwa, ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, kubula kolugulu lwa Lebanoni ntendele ya chenya na kulaila mo mto Eufulati mwe ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa kubula kwe bahali ya Meditelanea ntendele ya uswelo wazuwa. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Hahana mntu yoyose nadahe kuwahigani. Hohose namwite mwe isi iyo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawajele nkama awantu wawogoheni, saviya alagane.” <verse eid="DEU 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Kaulisani, dyelo dino nawaikiyani kulongozi kwenyu ujimbiko hegu ligito, <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />ujimbiko ni hadya mnatoza imiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ino huwenkani vino dyelo, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />na ligito ni hadya mnaleka kutoza imiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kuileka isila huwalagizani, niyo mwavikila milungu mituhu idya hamwaimanyaga. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Zumbe Chohile hadya nawabuzeni mwe isi idya mkwita kwikala, namlonge ujimbiko molugulu lwa Gelizimu, na ligito molugulu lwa Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Magulu yano yentendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani, ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa, mwe isi ya Wakaanani wakwikala Alaba ikusinyana Giligali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Namdeluke umto wa Yolodani mwingile na kwikala mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani. Ivyo, aho namwingile na kwikala umo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mkaulise kutoza imiko yose na malagizo huwenkani vino dyelo.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Hantu asagule Chohile hakuvikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Ino ni miko na malagizo namtimile umo mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wababa zenyu akuwenkani mwikale amazuwa yose yowikazi wenyu mweisi. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Balangani chila hantu hose wantu wakuvikila milungu yawo mwamagulu matali na mwawagulu na hasi he miti ina mani maisi. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Tulani nchanja zawo na kuzibogozola izinguzo zawo. Yatikimyeni amatukulu yawo yo kusongola ya Ashela na kuyakantakanta amatukulu ye milungu yawo yokusongola na kudyusa idizina dya aho ahantu.” <verse eid="DEU 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Msekumvikila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu saviya wantu awo wakumvikila milungu yawo. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Mna namwite hantu hadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nasagule mwa amakabila yose chani aike zina dyakwe na wikazi wakwe aho, uko nuko namwite. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Uko nuko namwigale ntambiko zenyu za kutikimya na malavyo yenyu matuhu, mafungu ya mlongo na malavyo ya nazili na malavyo yakweungila na welekwa wa nkongo wa ng'ombe na mbuzi na ngoto zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Uko, namdye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, namwelelwe hamwenga na wantu mwezinyumba zenyu kwa chausa cha ulozo mjimbikwe ni Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Mazuwa ayo yakabula msekutenda savino mkudamanya hano dyelo, chila mntu avika saviya akunga. <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />Kwaviya hamnati kwingila kweisi mkwakulisi mkwinkigwa ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu mwikale kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Mna aho namdeluke umto wa Yolodani na kwikala mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawenkeni mhumule msekuvigwavigwa ni wankondo wenyu wose nawawazungulukeni chani mwikale kwa utondowazi, <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />ivyo, aho ahantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nasagule chani zina dyakwe dikigwe, aho naho namwigale chila chintu naniwalagizeni. Ntambiko zenyu za kutikimya na malavyo yenyu matuhu, na malavyo yenyu ya fungu dya mlongo na nazili za kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Uko namtende na chinyemi kulongozi kwakwe Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nyuwe hamwenga na wanenyu wa chilume na wachiche, wandima wenyu wachilume na wachiche na Walawi wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu, kwaviya wowo hawana hantu hegu ulisi mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mkaulise msekulavya malavyo yenyu ya kutikimya hantu hohose mkunga, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />mna hantu nahasagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile mwe isi mkwinkingwa ni Zumbe Chohile. Aho naho namlavize amalavyo yenyu yo kutikimya, aho naho namdamanyize mbuli zose huwalagizani.” <verse eid="DEU 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Mna mwadaha kuchinja na kudya wanyama wenyu hohose mkunga mowikazi wenyu, saviya ujimbiko akwinkile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Wantu wose, wakuwagila kumvikila Chohile hegu wazavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile, wadaha kudya izo izinyama saviya mkudya nyama ya kapala hegu ya dondolo. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Mna msekudya sakame ya awanyama awo, itileni hasi hesanga saviya mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Hantu mkwikala msekudya vintu vilavigwe kwa Zumbe Chohile, malavyo ya fungu dya mlongo dye ingano yenyu hegu divai yenyu hegu mavuta yenyu hegu welekwa wa nkongo we izing'ombe zenyu hegu ngoto ne izimbuzi zenyu, hegu majeleko yenyu ya nazili hegu ntambiko zenyu za kunga, hegu malavyo yenyu matuhu. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Mna vintu ivyo namvidye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, hantu nasagule Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Namvidye nyuwe hamwenga na wanenyu wa wachilume na wachiche, wandima wenyu wachilume na wachiche na Walawi wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu. Namtende na chinyemi uko mwa chila mbuli namdamanye. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Naho manyani kugamba msekuwajala Walawi chipindi chose namwikale mwe isi yenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Aho Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nangamule isi yenyu, saviya alongile nyuwe namgambe, chaunga chidye nyama, mwadaha kudya nyama saviya mkunga. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Ivyo, hantu nasagule Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, aike zina dyakwe, aho mwadaha kuchinja ng'ombe hegu ngoto na mbuzi yoyose idya Zumbe Chohile awenkileni saviya niwalagize. Mwadaha kudya inyama ivyo mndani mwemizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Nyama ivyo namuidye saviya mkudya nyama ya kapala hegu dondolo. Mntu yoyose akuwagila hegu hekuwagila kumvikila Zumbe adaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Mna kaulisani msekudya sakame, kwaviya sakame ni ujima, ivyo, msekudya ujima hamwenga ne nyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Msekudya sakame, mna itileni hasi saviya mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Msekudya sakame weye na wanawo chani mchumilwe hadya namdamanye yedi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Vintu vikukile namlavye na malavyo yenyu ya nazili, namyaguhe na kuyegala hantu nasagule Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Aho, namlavye malavyo yokutikimya na nyama na sakame mwe nchanja yokulaviza ntambiko kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile nywenyu, sakame ye ntambiko namuimyage mlanga mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mna inyama mwadaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Kaulisani timilani milosi ino niwalagizeni, chani mchumilwe nyuwe hamwenga na welekwa wenyu mazuwa yose, kwaviya namtende mwadamanya yedi na kuwagila kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanyo mwe kuvikila matukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Hadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawakome awantu we izisi ntuhu kulongozi kwenyu, wantu awo namuwabalaze na kuwalavya na kwikala mweisi yawo. <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Mkaulise msekweingiza mwe mtego wa kuwatimila, yakaheza kubalangwa kulongozi kwenyu. Msekunga mmanye imilungu yawo, mkagamba, wantu wano nawavikila vivihi imilungu yawo? Naswi chidamanye saivyo. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Msekumvikila saivyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwaviya chila mbuli ikwihiza idya Zumbe Chohile hekunga, waidamanyiza imilungu yawo, hata ibula chipindi wawalavya wana wawo wa chilume na wachiche malavyo ya kutikimya kwa milungu yawo.” <verse eid="DEU 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Manyani kugamba mwadamanya chila chintu chiya niwalagizeni, msekongezeza chintu hegu msekuhungula.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Analaila muwoni hegu mlotezi ywa sozi mgati mwenyu, analavya maula masiku hegu uwoni msiku, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />vikaheza amaula ayo hegu uwoni uwo walaila, akaheza agamba, ‘Nachitimileni milungu mituhu na kuisankanila, milungu idya hamwaimanyaga’, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mse kumwetegeleza imilosi yakwe umuwoni uyo hegu umlotezi ywe zi sozi izo, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awajezani kujinkila wowo, chani amanye kugamba mwamunga Zumbe chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa myoyo yenyu yose na kwa myuye yenyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mtimileni na kumvikila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kutoza imiko yakwe na kuiva viya akulonga, msankanileni na kumtimila uyo. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Mna umuwoni uyo hegu umlotezi ywe zisozi izo akomwe, kwaviya natende kawahinyani wihi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Kawatendani muileke isila idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awalavizeni kweisi ya Misili mwendaga watumwa awalagizeni muitimile. Nivyo namuse uwavu mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Uneva mlukolo ywako ywa ndaimwenga, hegu mwanawo ywa chilume hegu ywa chivyele, hegu mkaziwo ukungisa, hegu mbuyayo ywa haguhi, akakuluvya kwa chinyele akagamba, ‘Nachite chikavikile milungu mituhu’, milungu idya weye hegu wababa zenyu hamwimanyize, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />hegu wamwe we milungu ya wantu wakwikala haguhi na nyuwe, hegu milungu ya wantu wakwikala hale kulaila mpembe imwenga ye isi kubula ntuhu, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />usekuzumila akakuluvya, hegu kumfila mbazi, hegu kumleka hegu kumfisa, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />mkome! Tenda ywa nkongo kumtowa mayuwe, vikaheza wantu watuhu wose nawatimile. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mtowe mayuwe kubula abanike! Kwaviya ajeza kuwegalani hale na Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, yudya akulavize Misili kudya kotumwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Ivyo mnawakoma awantu awo, Waizulaeli wose naweve na kogoha, chani wasekudamanya wihi sauwo vituhu.” <verse eid="DEU 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Aho namwikale mwe mizi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani, mwadaha mwive, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kugamba wantu wasiku weihiye mgati mwenyu, wawaluvya wantu wa momzi wawo wakagamba, ‘Nachiteni chikavikile milungu mituhu,’ idya hawaimanyaga, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />ivyo na mpelembe na kuzuza na kuza kwa ukanuni, na uneva nichindedi kugamba mbuli ya kwihiza ilaila mgati mwenyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />wakomeni kwa mabamba awantu wose wo mzi uwo, na kukoma izing'ombe ne izingoto ne izimbuzi zose kwa mabamba na kuubalamga umzi uwo. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Chisanyani ivintu vyose mtahile holumpe lomzi na kuvyoka moto saviya lavyo dya kutikimya kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nausigaile mahame kalenakale, mzi uwo hauzengwe vituhu. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Msekuguha chintu chochose chiligitwe chitende chako chitikimywe, chani Zumbe Chohile, asekuwafilani maya, awafileni mbazi, na kuwatendani mlozese saviya alagane na wababa zenyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />uneva du mnamwetegeleza Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kutoza imiko yakwe yose huwenkani vino dyelo, na kudamanya yadya yakumuwagila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Mazwela ya malombolezo yalemezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Nyuwe mwi wana Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, msekwesenga sale hegu kuwegula luhala kwa chausa cha kumlombolezeza mntu abanike saviya wantu watuhu wakudamanya. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Nyuwe mwi wantu wesimile kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, Chohile kawasagulani mtende wantu wakwe mwenye mgati mwa awantu wose wakwikala mwe isi.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanyama wakukutenda usekuzumilwa mwe kuvika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Msekudya chikwihiza kwa Zumbe Chohile mwe kuvika. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Mwadaha kudya wanyama wano wakutimila, ng'ombe, ngoto na mbuzi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />funo na mpala na nkongoni na dondolo na mpala na mpofu na ngulugulu, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na chila mnyama mta ngaga zipangane hantu haidi na akuseula, nuyo mnyama mkudaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Mna msekudya mnyama yoyose yudya ngaga zakwe hazipangane hantu haidi naho hakuseula. Msekudya ngamiya na kabuga na ndezi hata hegu waseula mna izingaga zawo hazipangane haidi, awo hawakuwagila kudigwa. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Msekudya nguluwe, kwaviya hata hegu ngaga zakwe zipangana haidi mna haikuseula, awo ni wazavu. Msekudya izinyama zawo hegu msekukufya ivimba vyawo.” <verse eid="DEU 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Mwadaha kudya chila samaki zesimile zina mapezi na magalatu, <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />mna chumbe chochose chikwikala mwa mazi hechina mapezi hegu magalatu msekudya, unadya ivyumbe ivyo hozumilwe mwe kuvika.” <verse eid="DEU 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Wadege wose wakuwagila mwadaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Mna msekudya awadege wano, lubatavuwa na mpungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />nkulumbiza na mazewe yesimile, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />kungulu yesimile, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />mbuni, lugawa, mgulo, vimpanga vyesimile, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />kungwi, njejemela, kungwi kulu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />mwali, ndeli, mnandi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />membe, koikoi wesimile, landalanda na kanundu. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Wadudu wose wata mawawa na mvumilo umo wakapuluka ni wazavu kwenyu, msekudya. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Mna mwadaha kudya wadudu wasiku wana mawawa.” <verse eid="DEU 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Msekudya chibudu, mwadaha kumwinka mjeni akwikala mwe mizi yenyu, adye, hegu mwadaha kumtagila mntu ywa si ntuhu, kwaviya nyuwe mwi wakuka wa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Msekwambika nyama ya ngoto hegu yakabuzi mwamele ya nine.” <verse eid="DEU 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Sentani fungu dya mlongo wo ulozo wenyu wa chila mhilimo. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Ukaheza hitani hantu hadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu asagule avikilwe, mkatenda kulongozi kwakwe namdye amalavyo yenyu ya fungu dya mlongo dye inkande yenyu ne idivai yenyu na mavuta, na yawelekwa wa nkongo we izing'ombe ne izingoto ne izimbuzi zenyu. Damanyani vino chani mhine kumtunya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Uneva intambo ni ntali kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kasagula hantu hakumvikila hale na kwekaya, naywi hamkudaha kwinula amalavyo yenyu ya fungu dya mlongo na ulozo wenyu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awenkileni, ivyo, damanyani vino.” <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />“Tagani ivintu ivyo vya fungu dya mlongo na kuguha izihela izo kubula hantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, asagule hokumvikila. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Jesezani izihela izo kwa chochose chiya namunge, nyama ya ng'ombe hegu nyama ya ngoto hegu nyama ya mbuzi, divai hegu cha kunywa chikali, namvidye na kwelelwa aho kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, hamwenga na walukolo wenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Msekuwajala Walawi wakwikala mgati mwenyu, kwaviya wowo hawana chihendo hegu ulisi mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Mwe chila udumo wa mhilimo wa katatu lavyani fungu dya mlongo dyo ulozo wenyu wose na kwika mpamba mwe mizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Iyo naitende kwa chausa cha Walawi, kwaviya hawana chihendo hegu ulisi wa sanga mgati mwenyu, na wajeni wakwikala mgati mwenyu na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wadya wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu, naweze wadye na kwiguta. Damanyani vino, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni mwe zindima zenyu zose mkudamanya kwa mikono yenyu.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Mhilimo wa Mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Chila udumo wa mhilimo wa mfungate muwalekeile mkuwatigiza wose. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Vino nivyo namdamanye, yumwenga amkopeshe Mwizulaeli mnyawe adyuse idyo iditigizo, naho asekujeza kumtigiza kwaviya Zumbe Chohile mwenye kaunga iditigizo idyo dyuswe. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Mwadaha kuwatigiza wajeni, mna matigizo ya walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli namyause.” <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni mwe isi idya akuwenkani itende yenyu. Hahana hata yumwenga natende mchiwa mgati mwenyu, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />uneva du mnamtimila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu kwa kutimila kwa kukaulisa imiko huwagambilani vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Ayo nayalaile kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawajimbikeni, saviya alongile. Nyuwe namkopeshe wantu walozize wa si ntuhu, mna nyuwe hamkope. Naho namlongoze wantu walozize wa si ntuhu, mna wantu awo hawawalongozeni nyuwe.” <verse eid="DEU 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Uneva hanatenda na mchiwa molukolo lwenyu mwe mizi ye isi idya Zumbe Chohile nawenkeni, msekutenda wabafu na wadala kwakwe. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Mna chulusani mikono yenyu na kumkopesha kwa kunga mwe yadya yose akunga. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Msinyise fanyanyi zihiye zisekuwengilani mwe myoyo yenyu, na kugamba, ‘Mhilimo wa mfungate, mhilimo wa kulekeila wadeni wihaguhi.’ Mnamfanyanya mlukolo ywenyu mchiwa kwa wihi na kulemela kumwinka chochose, uyo adaha kumwilila Zumbe Chohile kwa nyuwe, ayo nayatende ni masa mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mwinkeni mlukolo mchiwa kwa chisekwesekwe hehena kufuzuma, kwaviya kwachausa cha ayo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni mwe zindima zenyu zose na mwe chila mbuli mkudamanya. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Kwaviya wachiwa hawasweseke mwe isi, ivyo nawalagizani, mtende na chisekwesekwe kwa walukolo wenyu wakunga vintu na wachiwa mwe isi yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivyo vyakuwadamanyiza watumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Uneva mlukolo ywako Mwizulaeli ywa chigosi hegu wa chivyele anatagwa kwako, anakusankanila kwa mihilimo mtandatu, mhilimo wa mfungate, mlekeile ahalawe hako. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Aho nomlekeile, usekumleka ahalawe mikono bule. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mwinke kwa chisekwesekwe chiya Zumbe Chohile akujimbike, ngoto na nkande na divai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Kumbukani kugamba nyuwe mwendaga watumwa uko Misili, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, niyo awakombolani, nivyo vikuleka dyelo nawalagizani vino.” <verse eid="DEU 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Mna uneva anakugamba, ‘Hako sanihalawe’ kwaviya akunga weye na walukolo wako naho aunga kwikala na weye, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ivyo, nauguhe sazia na kumponkola idigutwi dyakwe kubula isazia iyo ingile molwivi, uyo natende mtumwa ywako mowikazi wose. Mjeseze seivyo umtumwa ywako ywa chiche naye. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Usekuwona udala hadya ukumlekeila umtumwa ywako, kwaviya, kakusankanila kwa mihilimo mtandatu kwa nusu ya maliho ya mndima ywa kulihwa. Damanya ivyo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako nakujimbike kwa chila nodamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa nkongo wa ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Msenteleni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, welekwa wose wa nkongo wa chilume mwedifyo dyako dye zing'ombe ne zingoto ne izimbuzi. Usekuzijeseza ndima izing'ombe izo, ne izingoto ne izimbuzi izo usekuzikanta amazoya yawo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Chila mhilimo weye na walukolo wako naudye inyama ya awanyama awo kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu hantu hakumvikila Zumbe nasagule. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Mna mnyama uyo anatenda na lema dyodyose, kugamba kaholomala hegu ni tuntu, hegu ana lema dyodyose kulu, usekumlavya lavyo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Unyama uyo naumdye ukatenda kwekaya yako, hamwenga na wadya wakuwagila na hewekuwagila mokumvikila Chohile wadaha kudya saviya mkudya kapala hegu dondolo. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Mna sakame yakwe usekudya, iyo itile hasi saviya mazi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Tozani umwezi wa Abibu na kudamanya Pasaka kwa ntunyo ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Kwaviya mo umwezi wa Abibu, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awalavyagani kweisi ya Misili nechilo. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Namumlavize Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu malavyo ya ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi hantu hadya asagule hakumvikila. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Mkadya inkande iyo ye Pasaka msekuidya hamwenga na migate ijeligwe hamila. Kwa mazuwa mfungate namdye migate heijeligwe hamila, iyo ni migate ya masulumizo kwaviya mwasunguzaga kukulawa Misili, ivyo, chipindi chose namwikale namkumbuke diya idizuwa mlaile Misili hantu mwendaga mkasulumizwa. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa mazuwa mfungate mntu yoyose mweisi yenyu asekwika hamila mwenyumba yakwe, na nyama ya yudya mnyama achinjigwe chisingi cha zuwa dya nkongo isekusigala kubula mtondo.” <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Msekulavya malavyo ya Pasaka mwe mzi wowose udya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawenkeni, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />mna namyalavye hantu nasagule Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu hakuvikila, aho naho namlavize lavyo dya Pasaka chisingi, zuwa dikahunga, saviya mwatendaga mwe chipindi ichiya mkalaila Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Inyama iyo na mwitipwilise na kuidya hantu hadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu asagule mumvikile, mtondo wakwe, namuye kwezikaya zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Kwa mazuwa mtandatu namdye migate heijeligwe hamila, zuwa dya mfungate nakutende mdugano mkulu wa kumvikila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, naho msekudama ndima yoyose mweidizuwa idyo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya ulozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Namuwaze majuma mfungate, hadya mkukongela kuvuna inkande. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Mkaheza vinani ingasu ya majuma kwa ntunyo ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa kulavya malavyo ya kweungila, namlavye saviya nawajimbikeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Elelwani kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nyuwe hamwenga na wanenyu na wachiche wenyu, wandima wenyu na Walawi na wanyika na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo wakwikala hamwenga na nyuwe. Damanyani ivyo hantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, asagule hakumvikila. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Kumbukani kugamba mwendaga watumwa kudya Misili, elo msinyise mtimile amalagizo yano.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya maheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Mkaheza kuheta izinkande zenyu zose na kufumbula izizabibu zenyu, vinani ngasu ya maheha kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Namdamanye ingasu iyo nyuwe na wanenyu wa chilume na wachiche na wandima wenyu, Walawi na wanyika na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawo wadya wakwikala mwe imizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa mazuwa mfungate namumdamanyize Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ngasu hantu hadya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu asagule hakumvikila, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni kwa ulozo wenyu wose na mwezindima zenyu zose, nanywi chindedi nambwede.” <verse eid="DEU 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Wagosi wose wa Izulaeli naweze kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nkanana ntatu chila mhilimo hantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu asagule hakumvikila. Mwe ingasu ye imigate heijeligwe hamila ne ngasu yo ulozo ne ingasu ya amaheha. Wasekwita kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile mikono ibule. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Wose nawalavye viya wakudaha kuligana na viya wajimbikwe ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe nkanto zikuwagila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Namsagule walamuzi na masekulu kulaila mwa amakabila yenyu mwe mizi yenyu idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawenkeni, awo nawalavye nkanto zikuwagila kwa wantu. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Msekwazaganya vikuwagila, msekuhingiza, msekuzumila kuhokela hongo, kwaviya hongo dyahosa walamuzi wahitwile ichindedi. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Mtimile vikuwagila du, chani mdahe kwikala na kulisi isi mkwinkwa ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Msekuchimalisa nguzo ya mti wowose wa nguzo ya mnungu Ashela hajihi ne nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Naho msekuchimalisa tukulu dyodyose dya nguzo ya mayuwe diya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako akudihiwa.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Msekumlaviza Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, malalavyo ya ng'ombe hegu ngoto ina lema dyodyose kwaviya idyo niihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Mwadaha mwive kugamba mwemzi umwenga mgati mwe imizi yenyu kuna mgosi hegu mvyele akudamanya wavu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu kwa kubalanga idilagano dyakwe, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />kwa kuvikila na kusankanila milungu mituhu, hegu zuwa hegu mnenge hegu ntondo hegu vintu vituhu vya kwembingu silagize vivikilwe. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Hegu mkeva ulosi sauwo, uzisani hegu ni chindedi, uneva ni chindedi kugamba chintu icho chihiye chidamanywa mwe Izulaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />ivyo, mlavyeni mntu uyo kuse komzi akatenda ni mgosi hegu mvyele adamanye uwavu uwo mtoweni mayuwe kubula abanike. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Mna nakomwe uneva hana ukuzi wa wantu waidi hegu watatu, asekukomwa uneva hana ukuzi wa mntu yumwenga du. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Wadya waukuzi nawo nawakonge kumtowa amayuwe, vikaheza watuhu nawamtowe amayuwe. Nivyo namlekeze wihi uno mgati mwa Izulaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Vyadaha nakulaile ulahi mtuhu mdala mwemizi yenyu, saviya kukoma kwa kasidi na kukoma suko kwa kasidi, hegu kulumizana mntu mtuhu, hegu vintu vya wantu. Vinalaila seivyo, hitani hantu hadya hasagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, hakumvikila, <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />uko namumwigaile mlavyantambiko Mlawi na mlamuzi nawatendeke aho mwechipindi icho, nanywi namlavye ulahi kwawo wowo nawalamule ulamuzi wawo. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Wakaheza nawalavye ulamuzi wawo hadya Zumbe nasagule mumvikile, msinyise umo mkadamanya yose saviya nawawalagizeni. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Namungwe mtimile kudamanya ivyo nawawagambileni na ulamuzi kwenyu. Msekuleka kuchintiza kwa ukanuni nkanto nawalamule. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mntu yoyose nambele mlavyantambiko hegu mlamuzi aikigwe aho amsankanile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mntu uyo nakomwe. Nivyo namuse wavu mgati mwa Izulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Vikaheza wantu wose naweve nawogohe hawadamanye vituhu chintu kwa ubezi.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo yakumunga seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Mkaheza kwingila mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani, na kwikala umo, nyuwe mnagamba nachike seuta achilongoze saviya wantu wa izisi ntuhu zichizunguluke, <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />mwadaha mwike yudya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, namsagule. Namwike mlukolo ywenyu yumwenga kulaila mgati mwa walukolo wenyu atende seuta mwenyu. Msekwika mnyika atende seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Mna asekutenda na falasi zilozize kwa chausa chakwe mwenye naho asekuwavuza wantu kweisi ya Misili chani akenkigwe falasi ntuhu, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kawafunda, kugamba ‘Msekujeza kuya uko naho.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Naho asekutenda na wavyele walozize, kwaviya anatende ivyo moyo wakwe nauhitukile, naho anase kutenda na hela hegu zahabu zilozize. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Hadya akutendele seuta aungwa atende na chitabu chiwandikwe izisigilizi kulongozi kwa walavyantambiko Walawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Chitabu icho natende nacho na kuchisoma chila zuwa mo wikazi wakwe wose, chani ahine kumtunya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywakwe, akatoza na kumtimila milosi yose ye sigilizi ne miko yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Umo akasoma isigilizi asekweduvya kwa walukolo wakwe wa Izulaeli, hegu kuwika hankanda umwiko uno kwa vyovyose viya, chani adahe kwikalisa mo ulongozi, uyo nawelekwa wakwe mwa Izulaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Chihendo cha Walavyantambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Kumbukani kugamba Walavyantambiko, kugamba wantu wose weidikabila dya Lawi wasekutenda na chihende hegu ulisi mwe Izulaeli. Wowo nawenkingwe hantu hamalavyo yakulavigwa ni wantu watuhu kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Naho wasekwinkigwa sanga mwe isi itende yawo saviya walukolo wawo, Zumbe Chohile nuyo ulisi wawo saviya Zumbe alagane.” <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Vintu vino nivyo nawaguhe walavyantambiko kulaila kwa wantu wakulavya malavyo, itende ni ng'ombe hegu ngoto, nawamwinke mlavyantambiko ichiga cha kulongozi, ulusaya no utumbo. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Na muwenke ichihendo cha nkongo cha ulozo wenyu we nkande, na divai, na mavuta yenyu ya mizaituni, na chihendo cha nkongo cha mazoya yezingoto zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Mwaungwa mdamanye ivyo kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kasagula idikabila dya Walawi dimsankanile saviya walavyantambiko mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="DEU 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Uneva mntu yoyose akulaila mwe idikabila dya Lawi aunga mwenye adaha kulawa kwemzi wowose udya wa Izulaeli kwita hadya hantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu asagule hakuvikila, na kwikala aho, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />aho adaha kumsankanila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywakwe, saviya wadya Walawi watuhu wakusankana kulongongo kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Nahokele chihendo ichiya cha nkande wakuhokela walavyantambiko watuhu, hata hegu nahokele wambizi mtuhu kulaila kwa walukolo wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko mwe vintu akuviwa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Umo mkabula mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu akuwenkani, msekutimila mazwela ya kwihiza yakudamanywa ni wantu wakwila uko. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Hasekutenda na mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu namjise mwe moto mwanawe ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche kutenda ntambiko, hegu mntu akukaula mlamulo, hegu hehu mhima ndege, hegu mgangana, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />hegu msai, hegu watowa mazongo, hegu mta kuseja mpepo, hegu mta kulombeza wazimu. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Kwaviya yoyose akudamanya mbuli saizo ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, kwa mbuli saizo zikwihiza, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awabalaza wantu wakudamanya mbuli seizo kulongozi kwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Mna nyuwe mchume kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Kwaviya wantu awo namguhe isi yawo na kwikala umo, wawetegeleza wagangana na wakukaula milamulo, mna Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu hakunga nyuwe mkadamanya ivyo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile nasigile wawoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Musa ajendeleza kulonga akagamba, “Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawasagwileni muwoni kulaila mgati mwenyu akwinga saviya miye, nyuwe mwetegelezeni uyo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Kwaviya icho nicho mumlombeze Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kudya kolugulu lwa Sinai iviya lwetangwa Holebu, mwe dizuwa diya mwaduganaga mkagamba, ‘Chive vituhu idizwi dya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, mna chisekuwona naho umoto uno mkulu, chinase kubanika!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Ivyo Zumbe Chohile niyo anigamba, ‘Awo walonga mbuli za ubala. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Naniwasagwile muwoni kulaila mgati mwa walukolo wawo akwinga weye, nanimgambile dyo kulonga, uyo nawagambile yose nanimlagize. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Nalonge kwa udahi wangu, yoyose yudya hamwive umuwoni uyo akulonga kwa udahi wangu, miye nanimkantile. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Mna muwoni yoyose nalonge kwa zina dyangu ulosi simgambile alonge, hegu muwoni nalonge kwa zina dya milungu mituhu, muwoni uyo nabanike.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Mna nyuwe mwadaha mfanyanye, ‘Nachimanye vivihi ulosi udya Zumbe Chohile haulongile?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Uneva muwoni akalonga chintu hambwe kwa udahi wa Zumbe Chohile, mna ichintu icho hachikulaila hegu kutenda chindedi, mbuli iyo Zumbe hailongile, muwoni uyo kelongela kwa kweduvya mwenye, msekumogoha.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Mizi ya Kusumkila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Umo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nabinde kuwakoma awantu wadya isi yawo akuwenkani, na mkaheza kwikala mwemizi yawo na mwezinyumba zawo, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />nampagule mizi mitatu mweisi nawenkeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, mwikale. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Nampagule ntendele ntatu mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawenkeni mwikale chila ntendele itende na mzi chani chila akumkoma mntu asumkile uko. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mntu anamkoma mnyawe hekambile, naho nendile suyo mnkondo ywakwe, adaha kusumkila mwe umwenga we imizi iyo ahonye ujima wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Mafani, mntu kaita na mnyawe kumbago wakateme nkuni, umo akachela umti, hoya yasomoka kulaila mo mhini wakwe, na kumkoma yudya mnyawe, mntu uyo adaha kusumkila kwe mzi umwenga, kwa kuhonya ujima wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Mna uneva umzi uwo wihale vitendese, uyo mta kuliha chikoda, kwa maya yatendese adaha kumtimila, na kumgwila na kumkoma uyo ahosize ifile. Hata hegu henkigwe nkanto ya file, na awo wenye waidi hawendaga na nkumbizi aho nkongo. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Nivyo vikuleka miye nawalagizani mpagule mizi mitatu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Naho hegu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, anayangamula imihaka ye isi yenyu, saviya awelisize wa baba zenyu, niyo awenkani isi yose idya alagane kuwenka awo wa baba zenyu namongezezwe mizi mitatu mituhu ukaleka ino. <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />Isi yenyu nayongezwe imihaka uneva mnasinyisa na kutoza amalagizo yano yose huwalagizani vino dyelo, niyo mwamunga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, na kutimila sila zakwe mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Pagulani imizi iyo chani mntu hena mlema anase kukomwa mwe isi yenyu idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkeni itende yenyu, naivyo kuwahosani mtenda na mlema wa kukoma.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Mna uneva mntu ni mnkondo ywa mnyawe anamwebunga na kumkoma, akaheza yudya umkomi asumkila kwe mzi umwenga we mizi iyo, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />aho wadalahala wo umzi uwo na wasigile wantu wamlavye uko komzi na kumwinkiza kwa yudya mlukolo mta kulihiza chikoda cho kukoma chani amkome. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Msekumfila mbazi, mna namuse uwavu wo ukomi wa mntu hena mlema mwa Izulaeli, chani mdahe kwikala kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihaka ya chikale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Umo mnengila mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu akuwenkani mwikale msekusa chilagiso cha mhaka wa wenyu, icho chaikagwa aho chikale.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Ukuzi wa mntu yumwenga haukuchinta kumkantila mntu mta masa yoyose hegu wihi mwe masa yoyose adamanye. Ni ukuzi wa wantu waidi hegu watatu du nuwo naulavyanye kugamba mntu uyo kabalanga. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Uneva mukuzi mdanti analaila kumlaha mntu yoyose mwe ubanasi msiku, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />aho awo waidi nawaite hantu hakumvikila Zumbe Chohile, kulongozi kwa walavyantambiko na walamuzi awo wemwendima ichipindi icho. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Walamuzi nawazuzise kwa kukaulisa, ulahi uwo, uneva mukuzi ni mukuzi ywa udanti, kamlaha mnyawe kwa udanti, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />aho nawamkantile saviya endile akunga akantilwe mnyawe. Nivyo nambinde uwavu uwo mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Na wantu watuhu naweve na kogoha, wavu sauwo haudamanyike naho mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Mwe mbuli saizo msekuwafila mbazi wantu awo. Ujima naulihwe kwa ujima, ang'oile ziso dya mnyawe naye ang'olwe idyakwe, ang'oile zino dya mnyawe naye ang'olwe idyakwe, afyoile mkono wa mnyawe naye afyolwe uwakwe, afyoile chiga cha mnyawe naye afyolwe ichakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe nkondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Mkaita kwenkondo kugomba nkondo na wankondo wenyu, mkawona myutuka ikukweswa ni falasi na bunga kulu dya wankondo kujinka idyenyu mse kuwogoha. Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awalavizeni Misili, natende hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Umo hemnati kukonga inkondo, mlavyantambiko nelavize kulongozi na kuwagambila wagomba nkondo, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Wantu wa Izulaeli tegelezani! Dyelo mwihaguhi na kwebungana na wankondo wenyu. Msekufachevu, hegu kogoha, hegu kuzingiza, hegu kuwogoha awankondo wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nuyo najesanye hamwenga na nyuwe mo kutowana na wankondo wenyu na kuwenkani uhuda.’” <verse eid="DEU 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Akaheza masekulu wa wagomba nkondo nawawagambe awagomba nkondo, ‘Hano hana mntu yoyose azengile nyumba mpya mna hanati kuizilula? Uneva nivyo, nauye kaya, anase kubanikila kuno kwenkondo niyo yazilulwa ni mntu mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Kuna mntu yoyose hano ahandile mizabibu na hanati kudya izintunda zakwe za nkongo? Auye kaya anase kubanikila kuno kwe nkondo niyo mntu mtuhu akubweda izintunda zezizabibu zakwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Kuna mgosi yoyose hano alombile na ehaguhi na kusola? Auye kukaya, anase kubanikila kuno kwe nkondo, niyo mgosi mtuhu akumsola umndele ywakwe.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Masekulu we nkondo na wajendeleze kuwagambila awagomba nkondo, ‘Togolani hana mntu yoyose hano afile chevu? Auye kaya, anase kuleka weyawe wakafa chevu sauyo.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Amasekulu we nkondo wakaheza kulonga na awagomba nkondo, wakulu wa nkondo nawasagule masekulu walongoze mabunga ya wagomba nkondo.” <verse eid="DEU 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Umo mwi haguhi kutowa umzi, nkongo wauzeni awekazi wakwe hegu nawazumile kuhudya hehena kugomba nkondo. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Uneva wekazi womzi uwo wanazumila kuhudya hehena kugomba nkondo, niyo wawavuguilani izinchili zawo, aho wantu wose we momzi uwo nawatende wandima wenyu na kudamanya ndima za kukundugizwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Mna uneva wekazi wo mzi uwo wanalemela, niyo wasagula kutowana na nyuwe, namuzunguluke umo momzi wawo na kuwebunga, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu anawenkani uhuda mwawo, namuwakome awagosi wose wo mzi uwo. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Mna wavyele na awana, neizing'ombe na vyose vimo mzi uwo, naviya vitahigwe vyose mwadaha kuviguha vitende vyenyu, mwadaha kuvibweda ivintu mtahile kwa awankondo wenyu, viya mwinkigwe ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Ivyo nivyo namwidamanyize imizi yose idya ihale ne isi namwikale. <verse eid="DEU 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Mna mwe mizi ye isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawenkeni, komani chila chintu. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Wakomeni awantu wose, Wahiti na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wapelezi na Wahivi na Wayebusi saviya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu awalagizeni mdamanye. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Chani wanase kuwahinyani yadya amaihizo nawakadamanyiza imilungu yawo, nanywi niyo mwadamanya masa kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Umo mkemalaya kuwebunga mzi kwa chipindi chitali, mkatowana kuutaha, mnase kubalanga imiti ye zintunda kwa kuisenga. Togolani miti ni wantu hata mwibalange? Kwaviya mwadaha mdye izintunda zemiti iyo, ivyo msekwikanta. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mna mwadaha kukanta imiti ya makalabaka mzengele ntantilo za kukweila mwe viwambaza chani mdahe kuutowa umzi na kuutaha.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Ukomi heukumanyika aihosize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Uneva mntu anabwilwa kakomwa mo luwala mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani mkekale, naho hamummanyize uyo amkomile, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />wadalahala na walamuzi wenyu nawelavize na kuhima uhale wa kulaila hantu ichimba chili kubula imizi ihaguhi. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Vikaheza, wadalahala wo mzi udya wihaguhi ne ichimba chiya nawaguhe ndama idya hainati kudamanyizwa ndima yoyose. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Wadalahala awo nawaiseleze indama iyo mwe bwandasi dikujuluzika mazi heyekunyala, naho idibwandasi idyo hadyalimagwa hegu kuhandwa, uko nawaivune isingo yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Walavyantambiko wo lukolo lwa Lawi waungwa watendeke aho. Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awasagulaga wamsankanile na kuwajimbika wantu kwa zina dyakwe. Wowo nawo nawatende walamuzi mwe mbuli za kutowana na milosi ya kuhigana. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Vikaheza idya indama inavunwa isingo, wadalahala wose wo mzi uwo wi haguhi no mntu uyo akomigwe, nawasunte imikono yawo na mazi mlanga mwe indama iyo, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />na kugamba, ‘Suwe hachimkomile yuno mntu, naho hachimmanyize uyo amkomile. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Elo Zumbe Chohile, walekeile awantu wako wa Izulaeli wadya uwakombole kulaila Misili, usekuwaikiya wantu wako kanto dya ukomi wa mntu hena masa, mna uwalekeile amasa ayo.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ivyo, isakame iyo itilwe haitende naho luhosa lwa lema dya ukomi kwenyu, kwa kudamanya ivyo, hamuwoneke mna masa mwe yudya mntu akomigwe kwaviya mwadamanya yadya yakumuwagila Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusona mwe mvyele atahigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Mkaita kutowana na wankondo, niyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awenkani uhuda, na kuwataha, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />uneva yumwenga mgati mwenyu adaha awone mndele mtana mgati mwa watahigwe, niyo ambweda amunga amsole, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />ivyo, uyo mgosi akumunga uyo namguhe na kumwigala kwakwe, mndele uyo nawegule izifili zakwe, na kusenga amakombe yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />ahambule izisuche zakwe zo utahwa avale ntuhu. Ekale chipindi cha mwezi mjima mnyumba kwa kuwomboleza welesi wakwe. Akaheza adaha amsole uyo mndele atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Uneva aho nyumani umgosi uyo hakumbweda, adaha kumwasa aite uko akunga, anase kumtaga, naho asekumtenda saviya mtumwa, kwaviya kamjela soni kwa kwikala naye mna hamsoile.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulisi kwa mwana ywa nkongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Uneva mgosi msiku ana wavyele waidi naho amungisa uyumwenga kujinka umnyawe. Na wavyele awo wakatenda wamwelekela wana chigosi, na mwana ywa nkongo kelekwa ni yudya mvyele hekumungisa, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />vikabula mwe dizuwa dya kuwenka ulisi, uyo tati yamntu asekujeza kumdamanyiza yudya mwana ywa yudya mvyele akungisa na kumtenda mwana ywa nkongo, akaleka yudya mwanawe dya yudya hekungisa yudya mwana ywa nkongo. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Aungwa amzumile uyudya mwana ywa nkongo, mwanawe dya yudya mvyele hekungiswa, na kumwinka viya viwagile enkwingwe nkanana mbili.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana chilume mnkani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Uneva mntu ana mwana ywa chilume mnkani, hekuweva welesi wakwe hadya wakamfunda, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />aho, welesi wa uyo mbwanga nawamgwile na kumwigala kwa wadalahala kwenchili yomzi. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Welesi awo nawawagambile awadalahala wo mzi, ‘Mwanetu ni mnkani naho hakuchiva, ni mbafu naho ni mkozi.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Aho wantu wo mzi uwo nawamtowe mayuwe kubula abanike. Ivyo nivyo namuse uwavu uwo mgati mwenyu. Chila mntu mwe Izulaeli neve imbuli iyo nokogohe.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi zesimile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Uneva mntu kakola masa yakumunga akomwe niyo akomwa kwa kunyulikwa mwe mti, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />chimba chakwe chise kwasigwa mo mti ichilo chose, mna chihambwe mwedizuwa idyo. Kwaviya mntu anyulikwe kaligitwa ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile nywenyu, nanywi hamuijele uzavu isi awenkileni Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, itende ulisi wenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Unawona ng'ombe hegu ngoto ya mnyawo yagile, usekwileka, mna ivuze kwa mlukolo ywako. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Mna uneva kwekaya ya uyo mnyawo ni hale naho uneva umwenye hummanyize, ivyo mguhe umnyama uyo wite naye kwekaya yako, ekale kwako kubula aho umwenye nezile. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Udamanye seivyo mwe mpunda hegu suche hegu chintu chochose chiya mlukolo ywako azize. Usekwenda huchiwone.” <verse eid="DEU 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Unawona mpunda hegu ng'ombe ya mlukolo ywako igwele mwe sila, usekuileka yambize kwinula.” <verse eid="DEU 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Wavyele wasekuvala suche za wagosi, wagosi wasekuvala suche za wavyele. Akudamanya ivyo ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Unabwila sasa dya wadege mwe mti hegu mwe sila, dina machinda hegu matagi na kadege kalamila amatagi hegu kakubatila amachinda, usekukaguha akadege. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Kadege kaleke kaita zakwe, mna amachinda wadaha uyaguhe. Unadamanya ivyo nauchumilwe nakutende na wikazi mtali.” <verse eid="DEU 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Ukazenga nyumba mpya, zenga chiwambaza mnkanda mo uwala, unasekulahwa umo mntu anagwa kulaila uko niyo abanika.” <verse eid="DEU 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Ukahanda mizabibu yako usekuihanganya hamwenga na mimeya mituhu, hegu sivyo ulozo wose hauwagile kujeseza chochose kwa Zumbe Chohile kulongozi, suwodu udya uhandile, iviya hata izintunda ze mizabibu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Usekulima nkonde kwa ng'ombe na mpunda zikwese jembe dimwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Ukasuma suche usekusuma kwa mazoya ya ngoto na chitambala chedi ching'aile hamwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Taliza visinga mwe zimpembe nne ze suche yako.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwe mbuli za mgosi na mvyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Uneva mgosi anasola mchiche akaheza nyumani aunga amwase, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />na kumzigiliza kugamba kadamanya mbuli za soni, na kumbalangila ntogozi zakwe kugamba suyo mwali umo akamsola.”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Uneva vinalaila ivyo, welesi wa uyo mchiche nawaguhe ukuzu we isuche agonele mwe nyinka yo mchiche ywawo kwa wadalahala kwenchili yomzi, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />na wagambe ‘Nachimloza mchiche ywetu kwa yuno mntu, mna haluse hakumunga naho, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />chakwehela ni kugamba amlaha mbuli za soni hambwe hambwile ni mwali. Mna ukuzi kugamba mchiche ywetu ni mwali nuno.’ Akaheza nakusule isuche ina ukuzi kulongozi kwa wadalahala womzi. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Aho wadalahala womzi nawamguhe yudya mgosi na kumjela milugwa. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Naho nawamtoze mntu uyo nkuda ya vihande gana vya mayuwe yakwitanwa chumbu na kumwinkaga tati yakwe dya uyo mchiche, kwaviya umgosi uyo kambalangila ntogozi mchiche uyo ywa Izulaeli. Mchiche uyo najendeleze kutenda mkaziwe naho hadahe kumwasa mo wikazi wakwe wose.”<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Mna uneva ulahi uwo ni wachindedi kugamba andaga suyo mwali, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />nawamwigale kolwivi lwe nyumba ya tati yakwe na wagosi womzi uwo nawamtowe mayuwe kubula abanike, kwaviya kajelasoni mwa Izulaeli kwa kudamanya uchilanga akatenda mwe nyumba ya tati yakwe. Nivyo namlekeze uwavu uwo mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Mgosi anafingwa na mkaza mntu, wose waidi, mgosi no mvyele waungwa wakomwe. Nivyo namlekeze wihi uwo mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Mgosi anabwilwa kagona na mndele alombigwe, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />wose waidi walavyeni kuse komzi na kuwatowa mayuwe kubula wabanike. Mndele uyo aungwa akomwe kwaviya hagutile lukunga vileke ambizwe hatahegu nendile emomzi, seivyo mgosi uyo aungwa akomwe kwa mayuwe kwaviya kagona na mvyele alombigwe ni mgosi mtuhu. Nivyo namlekeze wihi uwo mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Mna uneva mgosi kadugana na mndele alombigwe koluwala nakumkakalisa, mgosi uyodu nuyo nakomwe. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Mndele uyo msekumtenda chochose, uyo habalange vikuleka akantilwe file. Mbuli saiyo yaligana na mntu akumtowa mntu mtuhu na kumkoma, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />kwaviya mgosi uyo kata kumkakalisa chinguvu uko koluwala, hata hegu kaguta lukunga lwa kulombeza wambizi hahana mntu ywa kumwambiza.”<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Uneva mgosi anadugana na mchiche helombigwe, uneva anamkakalisa chinguvu niyo wafingwa, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />mgosi uyo aungwa amlihe tati yakwe dya uyo mndele vihande milongo mishano vya hela, kwaviya kamjela uzuvu, mndele uyo natende mkaziwe, naho hakungwa amwase mowikazi wakwe wose.” <verse eid="DEU 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Mgosi yoyose asekugona na mkaza tati yakwe kwaviya namjele soni tati yakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Wantu hewekuwagila kumvikila Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mgosi yoyose afuntigwe hegu adumulwe ulusi lwakwe hakungwa akehanganya mwe bunga dya wantu wakumvikila Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="DEU 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Mwana yoyose elekwe ni mgosi ywa Izulaeli mwe mvyele suyo Mwizulaeli, hegu mwelekwa ywa uyo mwana kubula lweleko lwa mlongo hakungwa akengila mwemdugano wa wantu wa Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="DEU 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Mwamoni hegu Mmoabu yoyose, welekwa wawo wose hata lweleko lwa mlongo, hawakungwa wakehanganya mgati mwa wantu wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Kwaviya walemelaga kuwenka nkande na mazi umo mwendaga mwe sila kulaila Misili, na kwaviya wamlihaga Balaamu mwana ywa Beoli kulaila Pesoli kudya Mesopotamiya eze awaligiteni. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Mna Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, hamwetegeleze Balaamu, hantu hakwe ligito idyo dihitukila kutenda ujimbiko, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kawaungani. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Ivyo, msekujeza kuwambiza awo watende na utondowazi na kuchumilwa.” <verse eid="DEU 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Ivyo mse kuwehiwa Waedomu, awo ni walukolo wenyu. Naho mse kuwehiwa Wamisili, kwaviya mwekalaga mwe isi yawo saviya wajeni. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Welekwa wa awantu kulaila Edomu na Misili, kukongela cheleko cha katatu, nawazumilwe kwingila mwe bunga dya wantu wa Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Untanda mwe inkambi ya wagomba nkondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Mkaita kwenkondo, mkaika nkambi, chila yumwenga asinyise anasekudamanya chintu chochose nachiwatende wasekuzumilika kwa Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Uneva mgati mwenyu hana mntu yoyose mzavu mwe sila yo kuvika kwa chausa cha kulawigwa ni mbeyu za cheleko nechilo, uyo nalawe kuse kwenkambi, hekale haguhi nenkambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Mna ikabula chisingi nahake, na zuwa dikahunga adaha kuya kwenkambi.”<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Mtende na hantu hekuzungulukila kuse kwenkambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mwevimpandwa vyenyu mwinule wajembe, awo namjeseze kusimba mabome na kugubika amavi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Inkambi yenyu yaungwa itende ikuka kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, ajenda mwenkambi yenyu chani awambule na kuwenkani uhuda mwa awankondo wenyu. Ivyo msekumleka awone chintu chochose hechikuwagila mgati mwenyu, vinasekuleka Zumbe Chohile akawalekani.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi zesimile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Mtumwa anasumkila kwako usekumvuza kwa sekulu ywakwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Nekale hamwenga na nyuwe hantu hohose nasagule mgati mo wikazi wako, hantu hakumuwagila. Usekumzila.”<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Mwizulaeli yoyose, mgosi hegu mvyele, hakungwa atende mchilanga hantu hokuvikila. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Hela yoyose ikulawana na mbuli zo uchilanga isekwigalwa kwenyumba yo kumvikila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kwa kuliha nazili, kwaviya mgosi hegu mvyele mchilanga ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Uneva mkakopesha hela hegu nkande hegu chintu chochose kwa Waizulaeli wenyu mse kuwatigiza chongezekelo, musekuwatoza chongezekelo mwe hela wakopile hegu nkande hegu chochose chiya msekuwatigiza chongezekelo. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Mwadaha kutoza chongezekelo kwa wajeni, mna walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli msekuwatoza chongezekelo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni mwezindima zenyu zose namdamanye mwe isi idya mkwita kuiguha na kwikala.”<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Ukaika nazili kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako usekukawa kuyusa, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ywako naitigize kwako, hunayusize nautende na masa. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Hunekiye nazili kwa Zumbe hukoile masa. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Mna usinyise kuchintiza nazili ulongile kwa mlomo wako, kwaviya nakumwikiya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako kwa kunga mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Unajinkila mwe nkonde ya mizabibu ya mbuyayo, wadaha kudya zabibu ivyo naunge, mna unase kwinula zabibu zozose mwe ntagulu yako. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Unajinkila mwe nkonde ya mbuyayo ina maiso ya uhemba, wadaha kuhasula maiso ya uhemba niyo wadya, mna unase kuguha bamba niyo wasenga uhemba wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Kwasana na kusola vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Uneva mgosi kasola mvyele niyo nyumani hakumunga kwaviya kawona chintu hechikumuwagila kwakwe. Ivyo umgosi uyo anamwandikila ulosi wa kumwasa niyo amwinka na kumbalaza mwe nyumbakwe. Akaheza amlavya uyo mvyele mwe inyumbakwe, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />akaheza asolwa ni mgosi mtuhu, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />uneva uyo mgosi ywa kaidi amsoile, akaheza naye amwandikila ulosi wa kumwasa amwinka na kumwingasa mwe nyumbakwe, hegu uneva uyo mgosiwe ywakaidi anabanika, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />ivyo yudya mgosi ywe nkongo hakungwa kumsola uyo mvyele kutenda mkaziwe kwaviya hakuwagila mwe sila ya kumvikila. Kwa kudamanya ivyo ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu mwe isi akuwenkani.”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi zesimile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Mgosi asoile ivino mazuzi asekwita kwenkondo naho asekwinkwa ndima yoyose ntuhu, alekwe kwa mhilimo umwenga, chani ekale kwenyumbakwe welelwe na mkaziwe.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Mntu yoyose asekuguha yuwe dya kusagila ditende ukombo, kutenda ivyo nisaviya kumtenda mntu ase kwambika na kumsweseza ujima.”<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Mntu yoyose namgwile mlukolo mnyawe Mwizulaeli na kumtenda mtumwa hegu kumtaga kweutumwa, mntu uyo aungwa akomwe. Ivyo nivyo namuse wihi uwo mgati mwenyu.” <verse eid="DEU 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Uneva mntu anatozwa ni manyonje yehiye ya nkanda mwaungwa msinyise mtimile amalagizo ya walavyantambiko Walawi. Viya niwalagize nivyo namdamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Kumbukani Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu viya amdamanye Miliyamu hadya mwendaga mwentambo mkalawa Misili.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Unamkompesha mnyao chintu chochose, usekwingila mwe nyumbakwe nakuguha chintu cha ukombo, <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />mna mgoje kuse mleke mwenye akwigaile uwo ukombo. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Hegu uyo mntu ni mchiwa vuza isuche yakwe usekwikala nayo chilo chose, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />mvuzize chila zuwa nechisingi, chani nechilo adahe kwegubika na kukulombezeza ujimbiko. Damanya ivyo chani uzumilwe kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Usekumbunyanya mntu mchiwa umwinkile ndima akulonda, atenda ni Mwizulaeli hegu wajeni wakwikala mwemizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Chila zuwa hedinati kuhunga, mlihe amaliho yakwe ye idizuwa idyo, kwaviya uyo ni mchiwa na amaliho ayo nimsuhi wo moyo wakwe, chani anase kumwila Zumbe Chohile, niyo watenda na masa.”<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Welesi wasekukomwa kwa chausa cha masa ya wana wawo, hegu wana wasekukomwa kwa chausa cha masa ya welesi wawo. Chila mntu nakomwe kwa masa yakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Msekwazaganya uwagila wa wajeni na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo. Naho msekuguha suche ya mwasigwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe itende ukombo. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Kumbukani kugamba nyuwe mwendaga watumwa mwe isi ya Misili, niyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, awakombolani kulaila uko. Ivyo nawalagizani msekutenda ivyo.”<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Mkavuna ulozo wenyu mwezinkonde mkalagaza maiso matuhu umo, msekuya kuyaguha, mna wasizeni wanyika na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wasigwa wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawo, chani Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awajimbikeni mwezindima zenyu zose. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Mkasingisa mizeituni yenyu kuvuna izintunda zakwe, msekuya kusingisa vituhu amatambi yakwe, mna wasizeni wanyika na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wasigwa wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Mkadahula izizabibu zenyu, msekuya kulogota zabibu zisigale mna wasizeni wanyika na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo na wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Kumbukani kugamba nyuwe mwendaga watumwa mwe isi ya Misili, nivyo vikuleka nawenkani amalagizo yano.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga uneva hana nkumbizi mgati mwe wantu waidi, niyo waita kulamwilwa kwechitala, yumwenga anabwilwa habalange, na umtuhu niyo akantilwa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />uneva yudya akantilwe kakantilwa nkanto ya kutoigwa milugwa misiku, mlamuzi nuyo namgambe agone hasi na kutoigwa kuligana na ubanasi wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Adaha kutoigwa milugwa ikubula milongo mine mna isekujinka aho. Mna anamongezeza kujinka aho natende kamjela soni mlukolo ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Usekuijela fuwo njeku ukujeseza kuhulula maiso ya uhemba.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwa mlukolo abanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Uneva walukolo waidi wa chilume wekala hantu hasiku na yumwenga ywawo niyo abanika hasize mwana chilume, mkaza mta ukwaga asekusolwa ni mntu mtuhu kuse ko lukolo ulo. Mlukolo uyo mta ukwaga aungwa amsole uyo mwasigwa chani amwelekele mlukolo ywakwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana ywa nkongo ywa chilume nelekwe, nawazwe kugamba ni mwanawe dya yudya mta ukwaga chani idizina dyakwe disekwaga mwe isi ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Mna uneva uyo mlukolo dya yudya mta ukwaga hakunga kumsola uyo mvyele mwasigwa, ivyo umvyele uyo naite kulongozi kwa wadalahala wo mzi na kuwagamba, ‘Mkuluwe dya mgosi wangu mta ukwaga alemela kunipala chani ajendeleze idizina dya mkuluwe mta ukwaga mwa Izulaeli, hakunga kunichintiza yadya yakumunga ya mkuluwe mgosi wangu.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Akaheza wadalahala womzi nawamwitange uyo mgosi na kulonga naye. Uneva achei kulahiliza kugamba hakunga kumsola, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />uyo mvyele mwasigwa nambase kulongozi kwa awo wadalahala womzi, namvule idikwapa dyakwe idimwenga na kumtwela mate moso na kumgamba, ‘Vino nivyo vikungwa kutendelwa mntu akulemela kumpala mkaza mlukolo ywakwe.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Vikaheza zina dye nyumba yakwe mwe Izulaeli naditende, ‘Lukolo lwa mntu avuligwe idikwapa.’”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo matuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Wagosi waidi wakatowana na mkaziwe dyo yumwenga anamwambiza mgosiwe kwakumgwila awegazi yudya akutowana na mgosiwe, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />namumsenge umkono wakwe wa kulume wa uyo mvyele, msekufila mbazi.”<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Msekutenda na vihimo vihaidi vyesimane vya kuhimila, chimwenga chizamile chimwenga chihuhile. Msekujeseza chihimo cha udanti.” <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />“Naho mwenyumbako msekutenda na vihimo vidi vya kuhimila, chikulu na chidodo.” <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />“Jesezani vihimo vya chindedi chani mtende na wikazi mtali mwe isi akuwenkani Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Wose wakudamanya mbuli seizo, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu aweihiwa awantu wakudamanya ayo.”<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagizo dya kuwakoma Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Kumbukani chisimo Waamaleki wawadamanyizeni umo mwendaga mwentambo mkalaila Misili, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />wawebungagani kwesila uko mwendaga mhwa na kuwatowa wadya wose wezile kunyuma kwenyu wasokele. Waamaleki hawamogohaga Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Ivyo, umo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nawahumuzeni kulaila mwe ugomba nkondo na awankondo wenyu wose wakuwazungulukani mwe isi idya awenkileni mwiguhe na kwikala umo, mwaungwa muwakome Waamaleki wose.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya ulozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Mkaheza kwingila mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu akuwenkani itende yenyu na kwikala uko, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />chila yumwenga ywenyu naguhe malimbulo ya chila ulozo alozole na kuyajela mwendangulu ayegale hadya ahantu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, asagule hatende hakumvikila. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Naumbase mlavyantambiko akusankana amazuwa ayo, na kumgamba, ‘Dyelo nalonga kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu, kugamba singila mwe isi awelisizaga wadalahala wetu kugamba nachinke.’” <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Uyo mlavyantambiko akaguha iyo intangulu imwemikono yako nakuika kulongozi kwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />wenawe naulonge imilosi ino kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, ‘Tate endaga Mwalamu akadwangaya uko na uko, niyo aseleza aita Misili na kwikala uko saviya mnyika. Uyo na walukolo wakwe wendaga wantu wajeche du umo wakaita uko, mna niyo wongezekela na kutenda wantu walozize wata nguvu. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Mna Wamisili wachidamanyiza wihi na kuchisulumiza, wachikunkusa chidamanye ndima ndala za watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Vikaheza niyo chamwila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wadalahala wetu, niyo eva indilo yetu, na kuyawona amasulumizo yetu na ndima ndala na masulumizo chinkigwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ivyo, Zumbe niyo achilavya uko Misili kwa maula makulu na vilagiso na mpituko. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Kachigala hano na kuchinka isi ino ina sanga yedi ikuwagila kulima na kudimila. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Haluse namwigaila Zumbe Chohile malimbulo yo ulozo we nkande mwe isi idya aninkile.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Ukaheza ika intangulu hasi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, na kumvikila uko. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Wenawe naubwede wedi wose udya Zumbe Chohile akwinkile weye na walukolo wako. Wagoneke Walawi na wanyika wakwikala mgati mwenyu mwelelwe chalumwe.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Chila mihilimo mitatu ikaheza, chila yumwenga ywenyu nalavye fungu dya mlongo dyo ulozo wakwe kwa chausa cha Walawi na wanyika, na wasigwa wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawo na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo chani wenkigwe nkande yose wakunga wakatenda mwemizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ukaheza naulonge kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, ‘Silavya kulaila mwe nyumbangu fungu dya mlongo na kuwenka Walawi na wanyika na wasigwa wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo na wabanikilwe ni welesi wawo saviya unilagize nidamanye. Sibalange imiko yako naho sijailehata imwenga. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Sidile fungu dya mlongo dyodyose umo halomboleza, silavize kuse kwe nyumbangu hadya nendile sikuwagila mo kuvika naho silavize fungu idyo kwa wabanike. Sikutunya weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu, sidamanya chila chintu unilagize. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Ukaule hasi kulaila mo wikazi wako ukukile kwembingu, uwajimbike wantu wako wa Izulaeli ne isi uchinkile, idya uwelisize wadalahala wetu, isi inasanga yedi ikuwagila kulima na kudimila.’”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wazumilwe ni Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Dyelo dino, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awalagizani mtoze isigilizi zakwe na malagizo yano. Mkaulise myadamanye kwa moyo wose na muye wose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Dyelo dino mlavyanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile, nuyo Chohile ywenyu, na kugamba namtimile sila zakwe na kutoza izisigilizi zakwe na amalagizo yakwe na kudamanya yadya yose akuwagambilani. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Dyelo dino Zumbe Chohile kawazumilani kugamba nyuwe mwi wantu wakwe mwesimile, saviya alongaga na kugamba namtoze sigilizi zakwe zose. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Nawatendeni mtende wakulu kujinka wantu wose aumbile mwe isi. Nyuwe namhokele ntogozi na ntunyo na kumanyika. Nyuwe namtende wantu wakwe wakukile na ugoli wakwe, saviya alagane.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi za Chohile ziwandikwe mwe mayuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Akaheza, Musa akatenda hamwenga ne vilongozi wa Izulaeli kawagamba vino awantu, “Tozani amalagizo yose huwagambilani vino dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Zuwa diya namdelukile umto wa Yolodani na kwingila mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, akuwenkani, namchimalise mayuwe makulu na kuyasiliba. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Mlanga mwakwe namuwandike imilosi yose yezisigilizi zose zino, umo namwingile mwe isi idya ina sanga yedi ikuwagila kulima na kudimila idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wadalahala wenyu, alagane nawo kuwenka. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Mkatenda mwintendele ya kaidi youmto wa Yolodani, namchimalise mayuwe hata mlanga molugulu lwa Ebali, saviya huwagambilani vino dyelo, na kuyasiliba. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Namumzengele Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, nchaja ya kulaviza ntambiko ya mayuwe heyesongolwe kwa chuma. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Heye, inchanja yoyose namumzengele Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, yaungwa izengwe kwa mayuwe heyasongolwe kwa chuma. Mlanga mwe inchanja iyo namumlavize Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu ntambiko za kutikimya. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Namumlavize malavyo ya utondowazi, aho namdye na kwelelwa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Mlanga mwa mayuwe msilibe namuwandike pwilili imilosi yose ye izisigilizi zino.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Ivyo, Musa hamwenga na walavyantambiko Walawi niyo wawagamba wantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Nyamalani mnetegeleze nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli. Dyelo dino nyuwe mtenda wantu wakwe Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Ivyo, namtimile viya akulonga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu na kutoza izisigilizi zakwe na imiko zakwe ziya huwagambilani vino dyelo.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligito mwe mntu hekutimila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Zuwa idyo Musa kawalagiza wantu kugamba, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Mkaheza kudeluka umto wa Yolodani, amakabila yano yakutimila nayachimale kulanga kolougulu lwa Gelizimu kuwajimbika wantu, kabila dya Simeoni na kabila dya Lawi, kabila dya Yuda, kabila dya Isaka, kabila dya Yusufu na kabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Makabila yano yakutimila nayachimale kulanga kolugulu lwa Ebeli umo maligito yakalavigwa, kabila dya Lubeni, kabila dya Gadi, kabila dya Asheli, kabila dya Zabuloni, kabila dya Dani na kabibila dya Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Vikaheza Walawi nawawevilikize wantu wose wa Izulaeli kwa izwi kulu.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“‘Aligitwe mntu yoyose akudamanya tukulu dya kusongola hegu dya kusana na kudichimalisa kwa chinyele, chintu chidamanywe na mikono ya msani icho ni ihizo kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">“Na wantu wose nawazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“‘Aligitwe mntu yoyose akumbela tati yakwe hegu mami yakwe.’ Na wantu wose wetikile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose akusa chilagiso cha mhaka wa mnyawe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose yudya akumwazaganya tuntu mwe sila ihiye.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose yudya akuhituila uwagilwa wa mjeni hegu mwasigwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe hegu abanikilwe ni welesi wakwe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“‘Naligitwe mgosi yoyose akugona na yumwenga mwa wakazize dya tati yakwe, kwaviya kamjela soni tati yakwe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose akugona na mnyama yoyose.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose akugona na lumbudye atende ni mchiche ywa tati yakwe hegu mchiche ywa mami yakwe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose yudya akugona na mkwewe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose yudya akukoma mntu chinyele.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose akuhokela hongo chani akome mntu hena lema.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Na wantu wose wazumile, Navitende ivyo!<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“‘Naligitwe mntu yoyose hekuzumila imilosi ino ye isigilizi na kuitoza.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Na wantu wose wazumile, ‘Navitende ivyo!’”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Ujimbiko kwa wakwiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Uneva mnatimila viya akulonga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu na kutozesa isigilizi zakwe kwa uzumizi huwenkani vino dyelo, uyo nawaikeni mtende wantu wakulu kujinka wantu wose mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Uneva mnatimila viya akulonga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, namwinkigwe ujimbiko uno.”<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Zumbe nakujimbike ukatenda wi komzi hegu wi kwenkonde.”<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Zumbe nawajimbike mtende na welekwa walozize na ulozo utendese na ng'ombe na ngoto zilozize.”<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Zumbe nawajimbikeni kwa kuwenkani nkande ilozize.”<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Namjimbikwe mkauya kaya na umo mkafosa kuse.”<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Zumbe nawahude wankondo wenyu aho nawawebungani. Naweze kuwebungeni kwa sila imwenga nawanyilike kwa sila mfungate.”<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, najimbike amagulu yenyu nezindima zenyu zose. Nawajimbikeni mwe isi idya akuwenkani.” <verse eid="DEU 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Zumbe Chohile nawatendeni wantu wakwe wakukile saviya alagane, uneva mnatoza amalagizo yakwe na kutimila izisila zakwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Wantu wose mwe isi wanawona kugamba nyuwe mwi wantu msagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile, nawowogoheni. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Zumbe Chohile nawenkeni vintu vilozese, wana na ludimo na ulozo mwe zinkonde zenyu mwe isi awelisize wadalahala wenyu kugamba nawenkeni. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Zumbe Chohile nawavugwileni mpamba yakwe yedi kulaila kwembingu na kunyesa fula mwe isi kwa chipindi chakwe, na kujimbika izindima zenyu. Namkopeshe wantu walozize mna nyuwe hamkope. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawatendeni wankongo kwa udahi mna sawo wa udumo. Namjendeleze kulongozi hamuye kunyuma uneva mnatoza amalagizo yakwe yose yadya huwenkani vino dyelo, kaulisani myadamanye, <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Mna mnasekuleka kuwatimila kwa vyovyose viya, kwa kuvikila milungu mituhu na kuisankanila.”<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligito ya kuleka kwiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Mna uneva hamnatimile viya akulonga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, naho hamnakaulise kudamanya malagizo yakwe yose nemiko huwalagizani vino dyelo, namgwelwe na amaligito yano yose.”<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Namligitwe mwe mizi yenyu na mwezinkonde zenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Namligitwe mwe zintangulu zenyu ze zinkande ne viya vyenyu vyo kokela imigate.”<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“Wanenyu nawaligitwe no ulozo wenyu we isi, na ludimo lwenyu naluligitwe lusekujenyela.”<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />“Namligitwe kwa chila chintu naudamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Uneva mnakola masa na kumlemela Zumbe Chohile nawegaileni ligito na nkumbizi na kufachevu mwezindima zenyu zose, kubula hadya namsunguze kubanika kwa ubanasi wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Zumbe nawegaileni manyonje kwa manyonje kubula wose mbanike mwe isi idya mkwita kwikala. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Zumbe Chohile nawatoweni kwa manyonje ya chifuwa chikulu na homa na maihu na fukuto na unyazi na nkung'unto na kungugu, mbuli izo naziwabwileni kubula wose mbanike. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Ulanga naunyale saviya shaba fula hainye, isi naitende saviya chuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Zumbe Chohile natende iditifili nomsa niyo ifula yenyu, tifili nadyo nadiwatifukileni mwe isi kubula wose mbanike.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />Zumbe Chohile nawatendeni mhudwe na awankondo wenyu. Nyuwe namuwebunge kwa sila imwenga, mna namuwanyilike kwa sila mfungate. Nyuwe namtende wantu wanawawona nawawogoheni mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Vimba vyenyu navitende nkande ya wadege na makala, hahatende na mntu wakuwabalaza. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Zumbe Chohile nawajele maihu ya kutumbuka, saviya awajeile Wamisili, nawajeleni nkwenje, na uhele mwe zinkanda zenyu na kuwawigwa ivyo hamdahe kuhonywa. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Zumbe Chohile nawatoweni kwa nkomano ya kutenda wachilalu, namtende matuntu na kutenda mapungupungu. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Namjende kwa kupampasa chilo na msi saviya matuntu naho hamchumilwe mwe zindima zenyu. Namzilwe chila nkanana naho hahatende na mntu ywa kuwambizani.”<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Namlombe wandele mna wantu watuhu nawawasole. Namzenga nyumba mna hamwikale. Namhande mna hamdye izizabibu. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombe zenyu nazichinjwe kulongozi kwenyu mna hamlume hata chihande che zinyama zawo. Mpunda zenyu nazipolaganywe kulongozi kwenyu, naho hamvuzizwe. Ngoto zenyu nazinkizwe kwa wankondo wenyu, mna hahana mntu nadahe kuwambizani. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Wana wenyu wa chilume na wachiche nawalavigwe kwa wantu watuhu kuno mkatumbula meso msi mjima hegu nawauye, mna hamtende na udahi wa kudamanya chochose. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Wantu hemwimanyize nawaguhe ulozo wenyu wose na izintunda mhandile wenye, nambunyanywe na kusulumizwa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Namtende mapungupungu kwa mbuli namuwone wenye. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Zumbe Chohile nawatoweni mwa mavindi yenyu na iviga vyenyu kwa maihu yehiye ayo hamdahe kuhonywa, nayawavambeni kukongela kwedifofo kubula ko lwayo.”<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Zumbe Chohile nawegaleni nyuwe na seuta ywenyu namwesaguile kubula kwesi idya nyuwe hemuimanyize hegu wadalahala wenyu. Uko namsankanile milungu mituhu idamanywe kwa miti na mayuwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Nyuwe namtende saviya vinyago na kwitukwa na kubelwa mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile nawegaleni.”<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Namhande mbeyu zilozize, mna namchisanye vijeche du, kwaviya sije nazidye ulozo wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Namhande mizabibu na kuyamila, mna hamdahule zabibu hegu kunywa idivai yakwe, kwaviya wadudu nawaidye. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Namtende na mizaituni chila hantu mwe isi yenyu, mna hamtende na mavuta kwaviya izintunda zakwe nazihuluke. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Namweleke wana chilume na wachiche, mna hamwikale nawo kwaviya nawatahigwe saviya wafungwa wa nkondo. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Miti yenyu yose yezitunda na ulozo wenyu mwezinkonde na vidigwe ni sije.”<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Wajeni wakwikala mwe isi yenyu na watendese na nguvu kuno nyuwe mkatenda wasokezi vitendese. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Wowo nawawakopesheni, mna nyuwe hamtende na udahi wa kuwakopesha. Wowo nawatende vilongozi wenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Ayo yose nayawabwileni nyuwe na kuwatimilani kubula wose mkomwe kwaviya hamtimile viya alongile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu mwe kutoza amaalagizo yakwe na sigilizi awenkileni. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Mna ayo nayatende ni ukuzi wa nkanto ya Zumbe Chohile kwenyu na welekwa wenyu mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />“Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, kawajimbikani mwe chila sila, mna nyuwe hamumsankanile kwa moyo wa chinyemi na uchumile. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Ivyo, namuwasankanile wankondo wenyu wadya Zumbe Chohile nawegaleini, kwa gumbo na kutenda mwilusi na kuhungukilwa ni chila chintu. Zumbe na watendeni mdamanye ndima ndala saviya watumwa kubula aho wose nambanike. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Zumbe Chohile nasunguze kuwegailani wantu kulaila hale wawebungeni saviya mpungu, wantu awo milongele yawo hemyamanyize. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Wantu awo watisa kouso naho hawana mbazi na mntu yoyose akatenda kadalahala hegu ni mdodo. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Nawadye ludimo lwenyu na ulozo wenyu, kubula hadya wose namkomwe. Hawawasizeni nkande na divai na mavuta na ng'ombe hegu ngoto kubula hadya wose namkomwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Wantu awo nawawazungulukeni na kuwachindani mwe mizi yenyu yose, kubula viwambaza vyenyu mwegamile vigwe hasi chila hantu mwe isi yenyu idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu awenkileni.”<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Aho wankondo wenyu wakawazungulukani na kuwatumbwadisani, nakutende na gumbo kulu nadileke mdye wanenyu mwinkigwe ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hata mntu aholese na aleligwe vyedi natende na sala na kumnyima mlukolo ywakwe, mkaziwe akungisa hegu wanawe nasigale, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />naho hampangile hata yumwe ywawo inyama ya wanawe akunga adye. Hamsigailwe ni chochose ichipindi icho cho kuzungulukwa na kutumbwadiswa nawankondo mwemizi yenyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hata yudya mvyele mntanda aleligwe vyedi mtana na mgoli nadamanye seivyo, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />umo umzi wakwe ukamzungulukwa, natende na sala itendese kwa chinyele nadye ulutiti lwakwe na chiya nachilawe akaheza kwefungula, naho hampangile hata mgosiwe akungisa hata yumwenga wawanawe.” <verse eid="DEU 28:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Uneva hamna sinyise kudamanya imilosi yose ye izisigilizi na kuditogola zina dikukile dikogofya dya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile nawegaileni nyuwe manyonje yakutisa na welekwa wenyu na masulumizo yakulumisa, masulumizo yatendese heye kuhonyeka mazuwa yose na manyonje yakulumisa. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Nawegaileni manyonje yadya mwendile mkayogoha mwe isi ya Misili, nayawebungeni mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Nawegaileni manyonje yesimane na nkomano ziya heziwandikwe mwe chitabu chino che sigilizi kubula wote mkomwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Hata hegu nyuwe mlozeza saviya ntondo za kwembingu, mna namsigale wajeche du, kwaviya hamwivile viya alongile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Saviya Zumbe Chohile awagilwe kuwadamanyizani vyedi mtenda mloze, seivyo Zumbe Chohile nawagilwe kuwegailani file na kuwakomani. Nyuwe namuswe mwe isi idya mkunga mwinkwe mwikale.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Zumbe Chohile nawamwaganiseni mgati mwa wantu wa si ntuhu kulaila mpembe imwenga yeisi kubula mpembe ntuhu, uko namsankanile milungu mituhu idamanywe kwa miti na mayuwe, milungu idya nyuwe hegu wadalahala wenyu hawaimanyaga. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Hamtende na mbwedo wowose hantu henyu wenye hakuhumula hegu mgati mwa awantu awo. Mna Zumbe Chohile nawajeleni nkama mwe myoyo, chazungu jaka moyo. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Mazuwa yose namtende na nkama kugamba wankondo wenyu nawawakomeni, wikazi wenyu hautondowale. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Myoyo yenyu naimeme nkama ya chila chintu namuwone. Mtondo namgambe, vyatendile chisingi.” “Chisingi chikabula namgambe, ‘Vyatendile mtondo.’ <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Zumbe Chohile nawavuzeni Misili kwa meli, ntambo agambaga hamkuye naho. Uko namjeze kwetaga kwa wankondo wenyu kutenda watumwa, mna hahana mntu nawaguleni.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Zumbe na Waizulaeli mwe isi ya Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Ino ni milosi ye dilagano diya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa kudamanya na Waizulaeli mwe isi ya Moabu, ukaleka ye dilagano diya Zumbe Chohile adamanye nawo ko lugulu lwa Holebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa awetangaga Waizulaeli wose hamwenga nakuwagamba, “Mwewonela wenye ivyo Zumbe amdamanyize seuta ywa Misili, wakulu na wandima wakwe ne isi yakwe yose. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Muwona wenye izinkomano zilozize, vilajiso na maula makulu adamanye Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Mna kubula vino dyelo Zumbe hanati kuwenkani fanyanyi za kumanya, mwe yadya yose muwone na kuyeva. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa chipindi cha mihilimo milongo mine, Zumbe Chohile kawalongozani mwe ntambo ya kwedijangwa, naho suche zenyu hegu ivilatu vyenyu mwavalaga havyasakalaga. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Hamwadyaga mgate hegu kunywa divai hegu ukozi wowose udya. Sidamanya ivyo chani mdahe kumanya miye ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Na eze mbule ahantu hano, seuta Sihoni ywa Heshiboni na seuta Ogu ywa Bashani wezaga kutowana nasuwe, mna niyo chawahuda, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />niyo chaguha isi yawo, chayapangilaga amakabila ya Lubeni na Gadi ne inusu ye idikabila dya Manase itende yawo. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Elo, mkaulise kutoza izimbuli zose ze dilagano dino chani mchumilwe mwe zindima zenyu zose.”<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Dyelo nyuwe nyose, mchimala kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, Masekulu wa makabila yenyu yose na wakale wenyu na masekulu wa wagomba nkondo na wagosi wose wa, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />wanenyu na wavyele wenyu, na wajeni wakwikala mgati mwenyu wadya wakuwatemelani nkuni na kuwatekelani amazi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Vino dyelo mwihano chani Chohile aike lagano dino diya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu akwika vino dyelo nanywi mdizumile, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />elo, vino dyelo nawalavyanye mtende wantu wakwe naye atende Chohile ywenyu, saviya alongaga kwa wababa zenyu, Bulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Lagano dino na maligito ayo sikudamanya na nyuwe du, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />mna nadamanya na mntu yoyose achimale hano na wadya hewenati kwelekwa.”<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Mwakumbuka ivyo chekalaga kudya Misili neivyo chitambile mwe zisi za wantu watuhu. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwawonaga amatukulu yawo ya kwihiza, milungu idamanywe kwa miti, mayuwe, chumbu na zahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mkaulise kugamba hahana mgosi, hegu mvyele, hegu lukolo hegu kabila dyodyose dikuchimala hano dyelo nadimwase Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, na kwita kusankanila milungu ya wantu wa si ntuhu. Imbuli ino naitende saviya izi nadikule na kweleka ntunda zisungu zina sumu. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Mkaulise yoyose neve izimbuli za amaligito yano vino dyelo niyo etumba kwa ukankalu wakwe kugamba hata akamleka Zumbe nahone, umtu uyo nabanike kulala mwe isi, wedi na wehiye. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Zumbe Chohile hamlekeile umntu uyo, naho amaya ya Zumbe Chohile nechinyulu chakwe na vimwimukile umntu uyo, maligito yose yawandikwe mwe chitabu chino nayamgwele, Zumbe Chohile namkomele hale umntu uyo. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Zumbe namsente kulawa mgati mwa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli agwelwe ni file kutimilana na maligito yose yawandikwe mwe ichitabu chino chedilagano.”<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Mwevyeleko vikutimila, welekwa wenyu na wajeni kulawa mwe sizii za hale nawawone ivyo Zumbe Chohile aigwisize isi ino file na masulumizo, <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />isi yose naimema chola na munyu, yokwa na kutikimywa itenda ibule, hahana icho nachihandwe naho haihote mbeyu yoyose. Ni saviya Zumbe Chohile ayokaga imizi ya Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu kwa maya yakwe makulu. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Wantu wose nawagambe, ‘Ni mbwani Zumbe Chohile akaidamanya vino isi ino? Amaya yano yaletwa nimbwani?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Na hitulo nadilavigwe, ‘Ni kwaviya wantu wa Zumbe waileka indagano aikaga nawo umo akawalavya kweisi ya Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />niyo waita kuisankanila na kuivikila milungu mituhu, idya hawaimanyaga aho nkongo, naho Zumbe Chohile awalemezaga wasekuivikila. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ivyo amaya ya Zumbe Chohile yemukaga mwe isi ino, na kuigaila isi ino maligito yose yawandikwe mwe ichitabu chino. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Zumbe emukagwa ni maya vitendese, niyo awausa kulaila mwe isi yawo na kuwadula mwe si ntuhu savino vili vino dyelo.’” <verse eid="DEU 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Kuna mbuli zimwenga Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, kazitenda chinyele chakwe, mna ziya agubule ni zetu suwe na welekwa wetu mazuwa yose, chani chidamanye izimbuli zose ze isigilizi ino.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Kumuwiya Zumbe vileke ujimbikwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Siwenkani lusagulo mwe ujimbiko na maligito. Mbuli izo zose zikawalailani nanywi mkazifanyanya hohose namwikale mwa wantu wa si ntuhu awo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawamwaganiseni. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Uneva mnamhitukila Zumbe, Chohile nyuwe na wana wenyu kwa kutoza izisigilizi zakwe kwa moyo wose na loho yako ulosi wakwe huwalagizani vino dyelo, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />aho Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, nawavuzizeni yedi yenyu na kuwafila mbazi na kuwachisanyani naho kulaila kwe wantu wa si ntuhu uko awamwaganiseni. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hata hegu mmwaganiswa mwe ntendele hale vitendese mwe isi, Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, nawachisanyeni na kuwavuzani, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />chani mwikale mwe isi umo wekalaga wakale wenyu. Uyo nawatende mchumilwe na kutenda mlozize kujinka wadalahala wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu nawatendeni nyuwe na welekwa wenyu mtende na myoyo wa kunyanyahala chani mumunge uyo kwa myoyo yenyu na loho zenyuu, mdahe kutenda na ujima mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, natende amaligito yano yawagwele awankondo wenyu wadya wawasulumizeni. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nanywi namtimile viya akulonga Zumbe Chohile na kutoza amalagizo yakwe yose huwenkani dyelo. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu nawatende mchumilwe mwe chila idyo namdamanye, namtende na wana walozize na ng'ombe zilozize, ne zinkonde zenyu na zilavye ulozo ulozese. Kwaviya nelelwe kuwatenda mchumilwe vituhu saviya elelwe kuwachumiziza wadalahala wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />uneva mnatimila viya akulonga na kutoza izisigilizi ne imiko yakwe iwandikwe mwe chitabu chino che isigilizi na kumhitukila Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu kwa moyo wose na loho yose.”<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Malagizo huwenkani vino dyelo sayo madala vitendese kwenyu kuyatoza, naho hayehale na nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Hayekwembingu, vileke mgambe, ‘Ni yuhi nakwele kulanga kwembingu achigaila chani chidahe kuyeva na kuyatoza?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Naho hayentendele ya kaidi ye bahali, vileke mgambe, ‘Ni yuhi nadeluke ibahali achigaile, chani chiyeve na kuyatoza?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Bule, yehaguhi na nyuwe naho yehaguhi na nyuwe wadaha ulonge na mnyawo naho myamanya, ivyo yatozeni.”<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Dyelo dino nawenkani lusagulo mwe yedi na yehiye, mwe ujima na file. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Uneva mnatoza amalagizo ya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, yadya huwenkani vino dyelo, uneva mnamunga Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu na kutimila sila zakwe na kutoza izisigilizi zakwe zose ne izinkanto zakwe, ivyo namwikale na kujenyela, uyo Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu nawajimbikeni mwe isi idya mkwita kwikala. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Mna uneva imyoyo yenyu inahitukila na kulemela kumwetegeleza, mwakweswa kuvikila milungu mituhu na kuisankanila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />miye nawagambilani vino dyelo namkomwe. Hamwikalise mwe isi idya mkwita kwikala ntendele ya kaidi yomto wa Yolidani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Nayukwila imbingu ne isi vino dyelo, kugamba nawenkani lusagulo chila yumwenga ujima hegu file, ujimbiko hegu ligito. Sagulani ujima chani mtende no ujima. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Mnamunga Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu na kumwetegeleza viya akulonga na kutimilana naye. Kwaviya kudamanya ivyo kwalagisa kugamba namtende na wikazi mtali mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile alaganaga na wadalahala wenyu, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa aguha hantu ha Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Musa niyo ajendeleza kulonga na Waizulaeli wose, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />awagamba, “Vino haluse miye nina mihilimo gana dimwenga na milongo midi, sina udahi wa kuwalongozani. Zumbe Chohile kanigamba kugamba sanideluke umto wa Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu nawalongweleni na kuwabalanga awantu wakwikala uko, chani mkatahe isi yawo. Yoshuwa natende chilongozi ywenyu, saviya alongile Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Zumbe nawabalange awantu awo, saviya awabalange Sihoni na Ogu, maseuta wa Waamoli hamwenga na awantu. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Zumbe nawatende muwahude, nyuwe namuwatendele saviya niwalagizeni. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mtoge naho mtende wakankalu, msekuwogoha naho wasekuwatisa, kwaviya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, naite hamwenga na nyuwe. Uyo nawambizeni naho hawalekeni.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Vikaheza Musa niyo amwitanga Yoshuwa, na kumgamba kulongozi kwa awantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Utoge naho utende mkankalu, kwaviya weye nowalongoze awantu wano kwita kwikala mwe isi idya Zumbe Chohile alaganaga na wababa zawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo akukulongoza, uyo natende hamwenga na nyuwe, uyo haleke kuwambiza naho hawalekeni, ivyo, msekogoha hegu kufa chevu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi isomwe chila mihilimo mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awandika izisigilizi za Zumbe, na kuwenka walavyantambiko wo lukolo lwa Lawi wadya wendile ne ndima yo kwinula Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe na wadalahala wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Akaheza Musa awalagiza agamba, “Chila udumo wa mhilimo wa mfungate matigizo yakalekeilwa mwe ingasu ya amakumbi. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Umo awantu wose wa Izulaeli wakeza kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile hantu hadya nasagule wamvikile namuwasomele isigilizi ino kwa izwi. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Wachisanye wagosi wose na wavyele na wana na wajeni wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu, chani chila yumwenga eve imilosi iyo na kuhina kumtunya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu na kutimila imilosi ye isigilizi ino. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kwakudamanya ivyo, welekwa wenyu awo hewevile izisigilizi za Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, wadahe kuiva na kuhina kumvikila Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, mazuwa yose namwikale mwe isi idya mkwita kuilisi ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe alonga na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, “Zuwa dyako dyo kubanika dihaguhi. Mwitange Yoshuwa, mwize hamwenga kwe Dihema Dikukile chani nimwinke malagizo.” Ivyo, Musa na Yoshuwa niyo waita kwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />uyo Zumbe Chohile niyo awalaila umo mwe nguzo ya ingu, inguzo iyo ye idingu naichimala haguhi no lwivi lwe Idihema.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Haluse wihaguhi na ku funda umuye, ukaheza kuumuye wantu nawakonge kunasa na kubasa milungu mituhu ye isi iyo wakwita kwikala, nawanase na kutula idilagano dyangu nilagane nawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Wanadamanya ivyo maya yangu nayawemukile mwe dizuwa idyo. Naniwaleke na kuwakanda mgongo, nawakomwe. Wavu ulozize na nkunto naziwebunge, aho naho nawamanye kugamba wavu uwo uwagwela kwaviya Chohile ywawo hehamwenga nawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Chindedi naniwakande mgongo kwaviya wadamanya mbuli za wavu na kuivikila milungu mituhu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Haluse, wandika inchemo ino, uwahinye wantu wa Izulaeli, chani utende ni ukuzi wangu mwawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Aho naniwegaleni mwe isi ina sanga yedi ikuwagila kulima na kudimila saviya nilagane na wababa zawo, awo wadya na kwiguta na kudamana, nawahitukile milungu mituhu na kuivikila, nawanibele na kubalanga idilagano dyangu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Umo nawebungwe ni file zilozize na nkunto, inchemo ino naitende saviya ukuzi kwaviya haijalwe ni welekwa wawo. Naho hata haluse, nichei kuwegala mwe isi nelisize kuwenka, simanya ivyo wakufanyanya.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awandika inchemo iyo na kuwahinya Waizulaeli waicheme mwe idizuwa idyo.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Akaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo amlagiza Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni amgamba, “Utoge naho utende mkankalu kwaviya nowalongoze wantu wa Izulaeli mwe isi idya niwelisize kuwenka, miye nanitende hamwenga na weye.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa eze aheze kuwandika imilosi ye izisigilizi kukongela nkongo kubula udumo, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />niyo awagamba Walawi wendile na ndima ya kwinula diya Idishanduku dye Dilagano dya Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Guhani ichitabu chino che isigilizi, mchike haguhi ne Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, chani chitende ukuzi mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Kwaviya simanya ivyo mwili wehi na wankani. Uneva mumhituka Zumbe Chohile chipindi nichei mjima hamwenga na nyuwe, navitende vivihi umo nibanike? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Wachisanye kulongozi kwangu wadalahala wose wa amakabila yenyu na masekulu wenyu chani nilonge imilosi ino weve, mbingu ne isi ziwaukwile. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Kwaviya simanya kugamba aho nanibanikile namtende wavu na kuileka isila idya niwalagizeni mtimile. Mwa amazuwa yakwiza na namgwelwe ni mabuli, kwaviya namtende wavu kulongozi kwa Zumbe na kumwihiza kwa ntendwa zenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Musa niyo achema imilosi ye inchemo ino kukongela nkongo kubula udumo kulongozi komdugano kwa Waizulaeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Tegelezani, nyuwe mkwikala kwembingu, tegelezani nyuwe nyose mkwikala mwe isi, milosi hulonga. <verse eid="DEU 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mahinyo yangu nayagwe saviya fula, milosi yangu yachabaza saviya mnyuzu, saviya mawaga mlanga mwe mani maisi, saviya matwentwe ya mlanga mwe mani maisi. <verse eid="DEU 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Nanilonge idizina dya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">‘Tunyani ukulu wa Chohile ywetu.’”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Zumbe Chohile ni luwe lwa kusumkila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">ndima zakwe zichinta, sila zakwe zose zawagila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Uyo ni Chohile mkanuni hena lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">uyo adamanya vichumile naho vikuwagila.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Mna nyuwe mswesa ukanuni kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">nyuwe hamwi wanawe naho kwachausa cho ubanasi wenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">nyuwe mwi cheleko chibanasi naho china masa.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Mwadaha vivihi kumliha ivyo Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">nyuwe wantu wahezi hemwine fanyanyi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Togolani, uyo suyo Tati ywenyu, mumbi ywenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">awatendileni mtende si?”<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Kumbukani mazuwa yomboke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">fanyanyani mihilimo ya vyeleko vilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wauzeni watati zenyu awo nawawagambileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wauzeni wadalahala wenyu wawagambileni.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Chohile Mkulu umo awasangilaga awantu we izisi ntuhu ugoli wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">umo awasangile awantu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">aikaga mihaka kwachausa che izisi kuligana no umligano wa wana wa Izulaeli, <verse eid="DEU 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />kuligana no mligano wa wana wa Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">mna nakeikiya awantu wa Yakobo watende wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">awo kesaguila watende ugoli wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Awabwilaga mwe isi ye idijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">nyika iyodu ina nkung'unto vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Kawadima na kuwatunduliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">saviya akudaha kwedima mwenye.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Saviya mpungu ikuhinya machinda yakwe kupuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">dyayatoza vyedi mwa mawawa yakwe ayangamule yasekugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">nivyo Chohile akuwadima Waizulaeli wasekugwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Uyo Zumbe Chohile mwenye awalongozaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">naho hahendaga na mlungu mjeni ywa kumwambiza.”<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Awajisaga muntu mwinukile mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nawo niyo wadya ulozo mwe izinkonde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Niyo awenka lude lulaile mwe mpanga wadye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mavuta yalaile mwe luwe lutogese.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Kawenka mabongo na mele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">naho mwendaga na lusagulo lwa nyama za ngoto na mbuzi zidamane zendaga zikadimilwa mo umzi wa Bashani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Awenkaga ngano yedi vitendese na divai yedi niyo wanywa.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wadamana, mna niyo wamhituka Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wadamanaga na kusesa izinda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">mna niyo wamleka Chohile awaumbile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">na kumbela Mwambula ywawo Mta Nguvu.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Wamtenda awone chinyulu chitendese kwa milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">wamsonga maya kwa ntendwa zawo za kuvikila milungu mituhu.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Walavya ntambiko kwa mpepo hazendile Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">wabasaga milungu hawajezaga kuimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">milungu mihya ilaile amazuwa ayano, iyo wakale wawo hawajezaga kuivikila.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Mumjala Chohile ywa chindedi awaumbileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">mumjala Chohile awelekeni.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Zumbe Chohile eze awone imbuli iyo, niyo awaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">kwaviya nakeihizwa ni wanawe wa chilume na wachiche.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Niyo agamba, saniwambize niwone uhelo wawo ivyo nautende!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Kwaviya wowo ni cheleko chagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">wana hewena ukanuni wowose.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Wanisonga maya niwone chinyulu kwa chintu sicho mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">wanitenda ningilwe ni maya kwa matukulu yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Ivyo naniwatende wawone chinyulu kwa chintu sicho mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">naniwajele maya kwa wantu wahezi.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Maya yangu nayayemuka saviya moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yoka kubula hasi kwe dibome hedina uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">nayabalange isi na viyumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">na koka vyegamo vya amagulu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“Naniwagwisize mabuli yalozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">naniwalase kwa mifulo yangu yose.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Nawanyazwe ni gumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nawakomwe ni manyonje yehiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Nanigale makala yana meno makali yawebunge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na nyoka zina usungu ziwalume.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Nkondo naihose file kuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na mwezinyumba zenyu namtende na nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">wabwanga na wandele nawakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">iviya wana wakonka na wadalahala nawakomwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nasunga, niwabinde wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">chani wantu wase kukumbukwa vituhu mwe isi,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />mna kowefenyi wa wankondo wawo, chani wankondo wawo wanase kufanyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kugamba wawahuda awantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kumbeke ni miye mwenye Zumbe niwakomile.”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Izulaeli ni wantu hewena fanyanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">wantu wakwe hawana umanyi mndani mwawo.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Watendile na ubala nawakubunkula chiya chiwahudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">nawadaha kumanya icho chiwalaile.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Mntu yumwenga adaha vivihi kuhuda wantu elufu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">hegu wantu waidi wadaha vivihi kuhuda wantu elufu milongo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Nikwaviya Chohile kawadula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Zumbe ywawo kawaleka.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hata awankondo wenyu wavimanya pwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">kugamba milungu yawo ihwa haikwinga saviya Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Kwaviya wankondo wawo ni saviya mizabibu ihandigwe kwezinkonde za Sodoma na Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">zabibu zakwe zimema sumu vikocha vyakwe visungu.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divai yawo ni saviya usungu wa nyoka.”<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Zumbe agamba, ‘Nakumbuka viya awankondo wawo wadamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">miye nagoja chipindi chikuwagila niwakantile.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Chikoda ni changu, miye nanilihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">chipindi na chibule hadya nawagwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">zuwa dya mabuli dihaguhi.’<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Zumbe Chohile nawagombele wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuwafila mbazi wandima wakwe, hadya nawone kugamba wasokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">hahana nasigale, mfungwa hegu mntu hefungigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Hadya nawone waswesa wambizi.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Naho Zumbe Chohile nawauze awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Ikuhi idya imilungu yenyu imituhu ikuwadimani msumkile?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Ikuhi iyo imilungu yenyu idile amalavyo yenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na kunywa idivai nezintambiko zenyu zo kunywa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Haluse igambeni ichimale iwambizeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">ilekeni itende nchinga yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“‘Kaulani miye nuyo Chohile ichedu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Hahana mtuhu ukaleka miye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Miye nakoma na nkwinkiza ujima, nalumiza na kuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">hahana akudaha kunichinda mwe chiya hudamanya.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nachulusa mkono wangu kwembingu na kwelisa saviya hwikala mazuwa yose,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />umo hanola idibamba dyangu dikumwekamweka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kuchulusa mkono nilavye nkato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nanilihize chikoda kwa wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kuwakoma wadya wakunihiwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Misale yangu naivyaje sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">bamba dyangu nadigute nyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">nadichabale sakame ya wadya walumizwe na wadya watahigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">mwe mitwi ya amasekulu wa awankondo wawo.’”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Elelwani nyuwe izisi ntuhu, hamwenga na awantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kwaviya Zumbe awalihiza chikoda wadya wose wakukoma awandima wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Aliha chikoda mwa wankondo wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na kudamanya wivano mwe isi na wantu wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa na Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, wachema inchemo ino Waizulaeli wose wakeva.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya kubindiliza ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa eze abinde kuchema imilosi yose iyo kwa Waizulaeli wose, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />niyo awagamba, “Kumbukani izimbuli zose ziya huwagambilani vino dyelo. Wagambile wanenyu, chani watimile kwa uzumizi mbuli zose ze isigilizi ino. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Kwaviya isigilizi ino siyo mbuli ya bule mna ni ujima wenyu, mnatimila isigilizi ino namwikale wikazi mtali mwe isi mkwita kutaha, ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani.” <verse eid="DEU 32:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Mwe idizuwa idyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Hita kwamagulu ya Abalimu kweisi ya Moabu ikusinyanyana no umzi wa Yeliko, kwela kolugulu lwa Nebo, ukaule isi ya Kanaani huwenka Waizulaeli itende yawo. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Uko kulanga kolugulu nobanike na kwelunga na wakale wako saviya mkuluwo Haluni abanike kolugulu lwa Holi na kwelunga na wakale wakwe, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />nyose waidi mwalekaga ukanuni wenyu kwangu kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli hadya mwendaga mwa amazi ya Meliba, haguhi nomzi wa Kadeshi, kwedijangwa dya Sini, kwaviya hamwatunyaga ukuka wangu mwa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Ivyo, noiwone isi ikulongozi kwako kwa luhale, mna hawingile mwe isi iyo huwenka Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa awajimbika awantu wa amakabila ya Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Uno nuwo ujimbiko udya Musa, mntu ywa Chohile awajimbike Waizulaeli henati kubanika.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Kagamba, “Zumbe ezaga kulaila kolugulu lwa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">kachilaila kulaila kolugulu lwa Seili, kalangaza kulaila kolugulu lwa Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Alailaga akazungulukwa ni wandima wa kwembingu elufu milongo wendaga hamwenga naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na mwali wa moto ukwaka momkono wakwe wa kulume.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Zumbe nakawaunga wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kuwadima wakukile wakwe wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Ivyo chamfikila madi mwe viga vyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kutoza amalagizo yakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa kachilagiza chitoze isigilizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">ni ugoli wetu suwe wantu wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Zumbe Chohile niyo atenda seuta ywa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">hadya vilongozi wawo waduganaga, na amakabila yose yaduganaga hamwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Musa agambaga kudilanga idikabila dya Lubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Lubeni ekale naho asekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na awantu wakwe wasekutenda wajeche.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Yuda kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Weye Zumbe Chohile utegeleze indilo ye idikabila dya Yuda wakalombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uwavuze naho kwa wadya awantu watuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Wagombele nkondo kwa mikono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">na uwambize mwe nkondo ya wankondo wawo.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Lawi, kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Ulimu wako na Sumimu yako wamwinkaga yudya mntu mkanuni kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Wamjezaga uko Masa na kuhigana naye kwa amazi ya Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Walawi walagisaga uzumizi kwako kwa kuwasa welesi wawo, wawajala wamnyumba mwawo, hata wana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">kwaviya watimila amalagizo yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Na kutoza idilagano dyako.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Na wawahinye welekwa wa Yakobo malagizo yako, na wawahinye wantu wa Waizulaeli isigilizi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Walawi nawavunkize ubani kulongozi kwako, walavye malavyo ya kutikimya mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Weye Zumbe, jimbika izinguvu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">uzumile ndima wakudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">balanga nguvu za wankondo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">wakuweihiwa wasekuchimala vituhu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Benjamini kagamba, “Dino ni dikabila Zumbe akunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Awo wekala haguhi naye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Awadima msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">namwike mwe chaha na kumdima.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Yusufu kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Zumbe ajimbike isi yawo kwa mawaga kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na kwa soko kulawa hasi.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Ijimbikwe isi yawo na ntunda zedi ziviswe ni zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">na ntunda za chila msimu,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />kwa ulozo wedi mwa amagulu ya chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">na kwa ulozo ulozese wa amagulu ya kale.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Isi yakwe imeme yadya ayedi, ijimbikwe kwa wedi wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Yudya alailaga mwa akasaka ko moto. Ujimbiko uno uwaseile awantu we idikabila dya Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">endaga chilongozi mgati mwa walukolo wakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Yusufu natende na nguvu saviya njeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">mahembe yakwe niya gosi dya mbogo, nayajeseze kuwasindika wantu kubula udumo we isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Elufu mlongo we idikabila dya Efulaimu na maelufu wa Manase.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Kuyalanga amakabila ya Zabuloni na Isakali agambaga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Zabuloni elelwe mwe izintambo zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na weye Isakali elelwa mwa amahema yako.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Nawagoneke wantu mwa amagulu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na uko nawalavye malavyo ya kungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Kwaviya awo nawenkwe ugoli wawo kulawa mwe bahali na mpamba zawo mo msanga wa mpwani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Gadi, kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Chohile namjimbike Gadi kwa kumwinka si nkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi ni saviya simba ikuhasula mkono hegu ngobela.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Esagwilaga sanga ihoile kujinka zose, hantu ha chilongozi hasagulwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Kawalongoza wantu kumtimila Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">kachintiza mwalo wa Chohile kwa Izulaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Dani kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ni saviya mwana ywa simba, akupilika kulaila mweisi ya Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Nafutali kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Weye Nafutali ujimbikiswe ni wedi wa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Isi yako ni ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi na ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa ye idiziwa dya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kudilanga idikabila dya Asheli kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Asheli ajimbikiswe kujinka wana wose wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">naho uhingizwe ni walukolo wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">atweze iviga vyakwe mwe mavuta ya mizaituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Mihindo ye izinchili zako naitende ya chuma na shaba. Nguvu zako nazikalise mo wikazi wako wose!”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa niyo abindiliza kwa kugamba, “Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli, hahana Chohile saviya Chohile ywenyu, akusela kulaila kwembingu kwiza kuwambizani, uyo eza kulawa kwembingu no ukuka wakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Chohile akwikala mazuwa yose, nuyo sumkilo dyako, mikono yakwe naikudime mweisi mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Awabalazaga awankondo kulongozi kwenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">kalagiza, ‘Wakomeni.’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ivyo, wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wekala mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">welekwa wa Yakobo ichedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mwe isi imemile ulozo na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">isi idya ulanga wakwe walagaza mnyuzu.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli elelwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ni yuhi esaviya nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">wantu mwambulwe ni Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">uyo ni nchinga ya wambizi wenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">bamba dyenyu, dikuwadimani na dikuwenkani uhuda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Wankondo wenyu naweze wakanyanyahala, nyuwe namuwajatangile.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">File ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Ivyo, Musa niyo akwela kulaila kwedibwandasi dya Moabu, aita kolugulu lwa Nebo, akwela kolunenengwe lwa Pisiga lukusinyana na ulailo wa zuwa wo umzi wa Yeliko. Aho Zumbe Chohile kamlagisa isi yose, kukongela Gileadi kubula Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />isi yose ya Nafutali, isi yose ya Efulaimu na Manase, isi yose ya Yuda kubula kwebahali ya Mediteleniya, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />idibwandasi dya Negebu na uluwala lwe idikolongo dya Yeliko, kugamba mzi we mitende kubula Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Akaheza Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Ino niyo isi idya ni lagane na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo kugamba naniwenke welekwa wawo. Sikulagisa wiwone kwa meso yako, mna kudya hobule.” <verse eid="DEU 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ivyo, Musa mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo abanika uko kweisi ya Moabu, saviya Zumbe alongile. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Zumbe niyo amhamba mwedibwandasi dya Moabu dikusinyana no mzi wa Beti Peoli, mna kubula vino dyelo hahana amanyize ahantu ahambigwe. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa endaga na mihilimo Gana na milongo midi umo akabanika, meso yakwe yendaga yachei kuwona vyedi, naho endaga mjima ngungulu mta nguvu. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Waizulaeli walomboleza ifile yakwe kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu kwedibwandasi dya Moabu. Matanga na malombolezo ye ifile yakwe niyo vyabindwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni endaga kamema loho ya umanyi, kwaviya Musa amwikiyaga imikono yakwe. Ivyo Waizulaeli wamwiva Yoshuwa na kutimila yadya Zumbe amlagize Musa. <verse eid="DEU 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Hahalaile vituhu muwoni mwe Izulaeli saviya Musa, alosane mlomo kwa mlomo na Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Hahana muwoni mtuhu adamanyaga mpituko na maula sayadya Zumbe Chohile amtumile Musa adamanye kulongozi kwa seuta ywa Misili na wakulu wakwe ne isi yakwe yose. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Hahana muwoni mtuhu adahile kudamanya mbuli nkulu zikutisa saziya adamanye Musa kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>